<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Namatayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni Namatayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Namatayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Namatayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni Namatayo phi imoka yo ichitabu ncheshe nhina Malhove o Naanano anohimiacha ukumi ni makhalhelho a Yesu Kuristo. Kila imoka aya ineehaniya “injili,” maana aya akhalhaka “malhove orera.” Chechiyo ichitabu chiyo chaalhepiye ni Namatayo, Namako, ashinna Luka ni Nayohana baada yo ukhwa wa Yesu. Attu o ushoma khachuwenlhe we ikekhiaye ikatema ilha ikitabu yo injili yaalhepiye ni Namatayo ilha vaalhepiye aya, nansho veekinaka yaari iyaakha yo 60 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Tho, khinochuwania ilhapo waalhepiye aya, nansho attu enchi anaanyihera wiira yaalhepiye Upalestina, ni veekinaka tho, iwani yulhupalhe yo Uyerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Alhepilhe ikitabu ilha phi Namatayo, yaari akarani o ulhiviha ikhodi ahinaya wiihaniya ni Yesu ukhalha owiittucha awe. Yayo tho aachuwania wo nchina ni Nalawi. Namatayo yaari mmoka a owiittucha khumi ni elhi, aalhempe wiira yashomiye ni Ayahudi. Yoyo mwaha uyo unowiichooniha mwaari vanohokolhelha aya miaha 60 chinaacha Malhove Matakatifu o Malhehano o Khalhayi. Namatayo aalhakenlhe wooniha wiira, Yesu aari Moopolhi, Noopo athanlhiye ni Nlhuku, aalhoheriye ni anamilhohi vatulhi vawo. Namatayo tho aholhepa venchi mwaha unaacha Umwene wa Nlhuku. Ayahudi yaari ammwehereraka Moopolhi uyo akhalhe phi ntawara o ilhapo aya. Namatayo aheechinanelha chinene uvaanyiha yoyo nrima uyo wo uhimiechesha rata umwene wo Nlhuku wo munrimani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo injili ilhepieye ni Namatayo, phi renre uchokholha Malhehano o Naanano ukhalhawaya miaha chonkhaye chinohokolhelha chittu chinaacha Malhehano o Khalhayi. Yeyo phi nolhutaaniha yayo Malhehano melhi ayo. Attu o ushoma tho ahohimia wiira, Namatayo aholhikacha ulhata iphiro chilhepiye ikitabu chi ashinna Musa, chiri phi ichitabu nthanu cho upacha nhina Malhehano o Khalhayi. Meettuchiho a Yesu o umwaakoni (Mat nlhako wo 5-7) anowooria ulhikaanihiya ni ikatema Nlhuku vaavaha awe malheheriyo ashinna Musa (Ikitabu yo Torati nlhako wo 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Namatayo anochokholha injili wo uhimiacha mwaha wo uyaria wa Yesu Kuristo ni uchokholha wo ntheko awe nhina (nlhako wo 1:1-4:2).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, Namatayo anohimiacha ntheko wa Yesu ni meettuchiho awe menchi (nlhako wo 5:1-25:3).</para>
  <para style="io">Wo umalhiha Namatayo anophiyelha ikatema ntheko wa Yesu vaari aya nchulhu ni unhimiacha nookhwa awe ni uhihimmwa wawe (nlhako wo 26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iyari ya Yesu Kuristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Alha phi machina a manyaapwiiya awe Yesu Kuristo o iyari ya Adaudi o iyari ya Aburahimu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aburahimu ni Naisaka ni Nayakhobo ni Nayuda ni achihimaya, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nayuda nkaayara Nafarisi ni Nazera anumwanaya yaari Atamari. Nafarisi ahaayara Nahezironi, Nahezironi nkaayara Narami, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Narami nkaayara Naaminaadabu, Naaminadabu nkaayara Nanashoni, Nanashoni nkaayara Nasalmoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nasalmoni nkaayara Naboazi, anumwanaya aari Narahabu, Naboazi ni Naruthu yaari manyanaangoro a Naobedi athumwanaya Nayese, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Naobedi nkaayara Nayese, Nayese nkaayara Amwene Adaudi. Adaudi nkaayara Naselemani (anumwanaya Naselemani aari Nabethsheba, mahanu a Nauriya). <verse number="7" style="v"/>Naselemani nkaayara Narehoboamu, Narehoboamu nkaayara Naabiya, Naabiya nkaayara Naasafu, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Naasafu nkaayara Nayehoshafati, Nayehoshafati nkaayara Nayoramu, Nayoramu nkaayara Nauziya, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nauziya nkaayara Nayothamu, Nayothamu nkaayara Naahazi, Naahazi nkaayara Nahezekiya, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nahezekiya nkaayara Namanase, Namanase nkaayara Naamoni, Naamoni nkaayara Nayosiya, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nayosiya nkaayara Nayekoniya ni achihimaya. Yeyo yaari ikatema Ayahudi vaari aya upottani Ubabeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ikatema Ayahudi vaarwehiye aya upottani Ubabeli, Nayekoniya nkaayara Nashaltieli, Nashaltieli nkaayara Nazerubabeli, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nazerubabeli nkaayara Naabihudi, Naabihudi nkaayara Naeliakimu, Naeliakimu nkaayara Naazori, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naazori nkaayara Nasadoki, Nasadoki nkaayara Naakimu, Naakimu nkaayara Naeliudi <verse number="15" style="v"/>Naeliudi nkaayara Naeliazeri, Naeliazeri nkaayara Amathani, Amathani nkaayara Nayakhobo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nayakhobo nkaayara Nayusufu owannyaya Amariamu anumwanawe Yesu neehaniya Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Paahi etu, iyari chaari khumi ni ncheshe toka wa Aburahimu mpaka wa Adaudi, ni iyari khumi ni ncheshe toka wa Adaudi mpaka Ayahudi vaakushiye aya upottani Ubabeli ni iyari khumi ni ncheshe toka ukushiya ipotta mpaka vaayarelhe awe Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="s">Uyaria wa Yesu Kuristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi etu, cho phi chiichammo chenre aya wo uyaria Yesu Kuristo. Amariamu anumwanawe aari anavekiye ni Nayusufu, nansho uhinaya ukhalhiya vamoka thoko nlhopwana ni ahanu awe, Amariamu ahoonia wiira aari veruttuni wo woorihiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nansho ukhalhawaya Nayusufu owannyaya ayo, aari attu o nrima woombone, khaathananne woolhiha muru Amariamu vaattuni. Paahi etu aholhakelha waahiya wo nivitho, wo uhichuwania ni attu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vaari aya oopuwelhaka nenno nlhove nno etu, Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi wahaakhuruwelha ntorani weeraka, “Inyu Nayusufu, mwaana a Adaudi, nhoove waakusha Amariamu akhalhe ahanu inyu, ukhalhawaya iweyi aya iyo iri wo worihiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Anowa wiittukulha mwaana mwanlhopwana, ni inyu mmweeke mwaamwihana nchina nawe Yesu, ukhalhawaya yoyo phi nolhoha woopolha attu ukhuma mu uwonyani mwaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paahi alha onkhaye alha yaakhumelhenlhe nitimire nlhove ni Athithi naahimiye ni anamilhohi wiira, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mwalhi hinaatameriya nowa urupalha irukulhu ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana nchina nawe nowa wiihaniya Imanueli.” Maana aya, “Nlhuku ri vamoka ni hii.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nayusufu vonkwilhe aya nkhoveni ahopanga thoko Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi chenre aya wo ulhehera. Nkaakusha ni waakhalhana ahanu aya. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nansho khawaarupiye vamoka mpaka vannyanre aya mwaana mwanlhopwana. Ni ayo nkayammaha nchina nawe Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Alheto ukhuma unosha nchuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu aayarelhe iwani yo Ubethelehemu ilhapo yo Uyudea mahuku Naherode vaari aya amwene. Avireke mahuku, achuwelhi o ittotwa ukhuma unosha nchuwa yahowa Uyerusalemu <verse number="2" style="v"/>nkayaakoha, “Mwaana nowa ukhalha mwene a Ayahudi yariye vayi? Ukhalhawaya nihoona ittotwa awe vaakhumelhenlhe aya unosha nchuwa, ni hii nihowa unthimichani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Amwene Naherode yeeweke yayo malhove ayo, ahokelhiya nipampa chinene, vamoka ni attu onkhaye o Uyerusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkeehanacha Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe onkhaye vamoka ni attu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa nkaakoha, “Kuristo nohalha uyaria vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Ubethelehemu ilhapo yo Uyudea. Phi chiichammo anamilhohi chaalhempe aya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>‘Inyu attu o Ubethelehemu ilhapo yo Uyudea,</para>
  <para style="q">Inyuva kanhiwe akani variyari wo iwani cho uchuwania cho Uyudea,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya uwaninyu nowa ukhuma nholhelhi</para>
  <para style="q">Nolhoha waaholhelha attu aka o Uisraeli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vavawo Naherode nkayeehana untemerani achuwelhi o ittotwa yaakohe wiira yoonelhe yaakhani. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkaaruma arwee Ubethelehemu yeeraka. “Nrweeke mwakoherere ikekhia yo malhove o mwaana uyo, mwamwoonaka, nkiwiihereke nttenga ni mii kirwee kanthimiche.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Baada yo wiiwa malhove a Naherode, nkayaarwaa. Vaari aya mphironi nkayoona ittotwa ilhe yaaholhelhaka ikhumaka unosha nchuwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vonne aya nkayaatelhiya chinene ni iyo nkayaaholhelha mpaka vaari awe mwaana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkayaakelhacha mpaani, nkayaamwona mwaana uyo vamoka ni Amariamu anumwane, nkayaakhoroma unthimicha. Nkayaathaphulha mirupa chaya ni ukumiha izawadi, idhahabu ni ubani ni manemane ummaha mwaana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkayaahokolhia umawannyaya aviraka iphiro chikina, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahaamuka ntorani wiira ahihokolhelhe tho u Naherode.</para>
  <para style="s">Uttawelha Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Alheto alhe athameke, nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi nkawaakhumelhelha Nayusufu ntorani ni weerelha, “Naherode anothanana umwiiva mwaana uyo. Munkweke etu munkushe mwaana vamoka ni anumwanawe ntawelheke Umisri. Mwakhalheke wowo mpaka vanohalha aka uhimeriani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nayusufu nkayonkwa nkayankusha mwaana vamoka ni anumwanawe nkayaathama ni uhiyu nkayaarwaa Umisri. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkayaakhalha wowo mpaka Naherode vaakhwilhe aya. Nenno nlhove nno naapangia nitimire nlhove ni Athithi wo iphiro yo anamilhohi neera, “Kahomwiihana mwaamwanaka ukhuma Umisri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wiivakachiya ashaana ashinkani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Naherode yachuwelheke wiira achuwelhi o ttotwa alhe ahaathepiacha, ahorushiya chinene. Nkaalhehera wiira ashaana ashilhopwana onkhaye o iwani yo Ubethelehemu ni iwani cho waatamana, o malhipa o iyaakha pilhi ukhuruwa vathi yeevakachiye. Aapangilhe chiicho uttwaraana ni mahuku veewilhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo ukhuma wa achuwelhi o ttotwa alhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Phi chiichammo chenre aya wo utimira malhove yaahimiye wo iphiro ya anamilhohi Nayeremiya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nlhove niheewania Uraama.</para>
  <para style="q">Ikutto yulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q">Araheli yonlhelhaka achishaana aya,</para>
  <para style="q">Akhotaka umalhihiya,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya khaawo tho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uhokolhia ukhuma Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naherode yarimeelheke, nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi wahaakhumelhelha Nayusufu ntorani Umisri <verse number="20" style="v"/>nkaweerelha, “Munkweke, munkusheke mwaana vamoka ni anumwanawe nhokolhieke tho ilhapo yo Uisraeli, ukhalhawaya alhe yaathanana ukumi wa mwaana uyo ahokhwa.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nayusufu ahonkwa, nkankusha mwaana vamoka ni anumwanawe nkayaahokolhia wi ilhapo yo Uisraeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho Nayusufu yeeweke wiira Akelao mwaana a Naherode aari phi mwene o Uyudea nipuro ni athumwanawe, ahoova uhokolhia wowo. Ni ayo ahovahiya malhove makina ntorani o uchiichihiya, nkaarwa Ugalilaya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nkaathamelha iwani yo Unazareti. Phenre aya wo utimira malhove yahimiye ni anamilhohi wiira “Nowa wiihaniya Nnazarayo.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho a Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yayo mahuku ayo Nayohana Obatiiza ahokumelhelha uthako wo Uyudea, nkaachokholha wettuchiha attu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yaari yeeraka, “Nkhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu, ukhalhawaya Imwene yo wiirimu ihaatameria!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nayohana phi alhe aahimiye ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya venre aya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ntu nookhuwelha muuthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nkooroshe iphiro ya Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q">Mwookolhe iphiro chaya cho uvira!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nayohana ayo yaawara ikuwo chaatottiye wo mapururu o ingamiya, ni nchako nnyununi mwaya, cholhia chaya chaari nashombe ni urawo wo umwiini. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Attu ukhuma Uyerusalemu ni ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyudea, ni ilhapo cho nchereshere mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ahowa uwiiwelhelhani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkayaakhoroma ni uhimiacha uwonya waya, nkaabatiizacha mmwoolhokoni Uyorodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nayohana yooneke Amafarisayo ni Amasadukayo enchi awaachaka athananaka ubatiiziya nkeerelha, “Inyu iyari yo inwaa nhimeriye ni apani wiira nttawe ntwarusho Nlhuku unowiiha awe? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwooniheke etu wo mitheko wiira nhorukunuwa ni uhiya uwonya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nhaanyihere wiira nihanaa athumwanihu, Aburahimu ukhalhawaya kinouhimeriani wiira Nlhuku noworia uthathusha alha malhuku alha nkaakhalha ashaana a Aburahimu! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ipacho iri tayari ukakha mwiri vamithithaarini, kila mwiri uhinemma rata unookakhiya ni urihelhiya vamooroni. <verse number="11" style="v"/>mii kinobatiizani wo maashi wooniha wiira nhokhoroma, nansho nowa vatulhi waka nowa uubatiizani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni mooro. Akhalhaka muulhupahe ukipwaha mii, kihiphwanelhiyaka inakhalhaka ukusha iratu chawe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yoyo novarelha mmononi ithelho yo uveerelha cholhia, wiira akhungure cholhia chawe, athokorerie ingaano nnikhupini, ni upaha iphepuwa vamooroni vahintiphiaa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ubatiiziya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu nkaawa akhumaka Ugalilaya, nkaawa u Nayohana umwolhokoni Uyorodani ni uyo abatiiziye ni Nayohana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho Nayohana aholhikacha unkhotelha eeraka, “Mii phi nophwanelhiya ubatiiziya ni inyuva, chani woonaka nnowa uwannyaka mii!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nhiye chikhalhe chiicho wo naanano va, ukhalhawaya wo yeyo iphiro iyo ninoopanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku chonkhaye.” Vavawo Nayohana nkayaarumelhelha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke ubatiiziya, ahokhuma mmaashini. Irimu nkayaahulhiaa, nkamwoona Iphumu ya Nlhuku akhuruwaka thoko kaulha ni unkorweelha vachulhu vawe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nlhove ukhuma wiirimu nkaneera, “Ulha phi mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka, hokichivelha.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ulhikachiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yamalheke, Iphumu ya Nlhuku ahonholhelha Yesu mpaka uthakoni alhikachye ni Nakare. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkaattuka wo mahuku makhumi ncheshe uthana ni uhiyu wo uhilhia, nkaawolhiya ithalha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nthepi nkanrwelha nkeera, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi mwaana a Nlhuku, wiireke etu alha malhuku alha athathuwe ukhalha mikatte.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Iholhepiya, ‘Ntu khanolhama wo nkatte vekha, nansho wo nlhove ninohimiya ni Nlhuku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nakare nkankusha mpaka Uyerusalemu, Iwani Itakatifu, nkaamwemesha vachulhu ishanja yo Inupa ya Nlhuku, <verse number="6" style="v"/>nkeera, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi mwaana a Nlhuku uthupheke mpaka vathi ukhalhawaya iholhepiya wiira.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nlhuku nowaalhehera minepa cho wiirimu awe chiwe wo nlhatu winyu,</para>
  <para style="q">Okusheni mmathathani mwaya,</para>
  <para style="q">Nhiwe mwaakwakwathuwa mmalhukuni.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha nkeera, “Iholhepiya tho wiira, ‘Nhaalhikache Athithi, Nlhuku inyu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yamalheke Nakare nkankusha vachulhu mwaako wo urekama, nkaamwoniha imwene chonkhaye cho velhaponi va ni urera waya wonkhaye. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkeera, “Chii chonkhaye chi kinowuvaha wakikhoromelhaka ni ukithimicha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vavawo Yesu nkaakhulha, “Uthame vaa uwe Nakare! Iholhepiya, ‘Mwaathimicheke Athithi, Nlhuku inyu vekha aya ni uvara mitheko chaya!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Paahi Nakare nkanhiya Yesu, ni minepa cho wiirimu nkachaawa ni unkavihera.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noochokholha ntheko Ugalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu eeweke wiira Nayohana ahottukiya, ahohokolhia Ugalilaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho kaakhanlhe Unazareti, nkaarwaa Ukapenaumu, ilhapo iri vachereshere nttiya no Ugalilaya, mmwinanoni mwo Uzabuloni ni Unaftali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Phi chiicho chenre aya wo utimira nlhove naahimiye ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya venre aya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ilhapo yo Uzabuloni ni ilhapo yo Unaftali,</para>
  <para style="q">Iphiro yo unttiyani, ukhopelhelhe Uyorodani,</para>
  <para style="q">Ugalilaya, ilhapo ya attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Attu anokhalha mwiipiphini</para>
  <para style="q">Anowa woona nthuko mulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q">Wa attu anokhalha nhina ilhapo yo irungu yo nookhwa</para>
  <para style="q">Nthuko unowa waamwalhelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Toka yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu nkaachokholha wiittuchiha eeraka “Nkhoromeke nhiyeke uwonya winyu, ukhalhawaya Imwene yo wiirimu ihaatameria!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noowehana attu acheshe o uvara ihopa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe eetaka vachereshere nttiya no Ugalilaya, ahoona attu o uvara ihopa elhi, Nasimoni eehaniya Peturo ni ahima aya Naandorea, ariaka ihopa ni nttavi munttiyani. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nkittware, ni mii kinowittuchihani woopolha attu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkayaahiyacha ittavi chaya ni unttwara.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Arweeke miholho nkoona attu akina elhi, Nayakhobo ashaana a Nazebedayo ni nhima aya Yohana. Yayo yaari nkalhavani vamoka ni athumwanaya Nazebedayo ayo alhokihachaka ittavi chaya. Yesu nkeehanacha, <verse number="22" style="v"/>ni ayo nkayaahiyera ikalhava iyo athumwanaya, nkayanttwara.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweettuchiha attu ni waalhamiha mareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:7-19">Luk 6:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu aari eetakachaka ni wiittuchiha mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ilhapo yonkhaye yo Ugalilaya ahimiachaka Malhove Orera anohimia Imwene yo wiirimu, ni waalhamiha attu kila mareta yaarina aya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwaha wawe nkawaawanelha ilhapo chonkhaye cho Usiriya, nkaawiiheriya attu aawereiya, yaari ni mareta ni alhe aahuvihachiya, attu aakelhiye ni mashoka o unanara, ichilhichilhi ni attu o remara ni Yesu nkaalhamihacha onkhaye. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Milhoko cha attu chinchi nkachanttwara ukhuma Ugalilaya, Udekapoli, Uyerusalemu, Uyudea ni ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o umwaakoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ooneke milhoko cha owiittucha awe, nkaawelha vamwaakoni, nkaakhalha. Owiittucha awe nkayaawacha, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ni uyo nkaapatakulha malhaku awe nkaachokholha weettuchiha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mpuha wo ikeekhene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu o nrima unohuvelha uchuwelha nlhove na Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku phi yawaya!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu anonlha,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya anomaalhihiya.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu arii ni nrima wo wiitimarikha,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya phi nohalha uhiyeriya ilhapo!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu ammolhiya ithalha ni nttona no upanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya anowa uwonihiya!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu o ikiriri,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nowa waahiyerera milhatu chaya!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu o nrima worera,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya anowa umwoona Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu aneewananiha attu,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya anowa wiihaniya ashaana a Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ahoreeriya attu anohuvihiya wo nlhatu wo upanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya Imwene yo wiirimu phi yawaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nhoreeriya inyu mwaattiva, attu oruwanakani ni uthurulhani ni uwotheriani wo kila iphiro yo unanara wo nlhatu no ukirumelhelha mii. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nteelhiyeke ni uttapelhelha ukhalhawaya uttuviya winyu uhenchiva wiirimu. Phi chiichammo chaathurulhachiye aya anamilhohi yaari nhinaaya inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maakha ni nthuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwaattiva phi maakha a attu onkhaye. Nansho maakha athuwaka anohalha uchivihani? Khanolhoka tho, yaahikhalhe urihiya vattayani ni unyikalhiya ni attu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mwaattiva phi nthuko wo velhaponi. Iwani ithekiye vachulhu mwaako khineevitha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu noparihelha ikhandiri ni ukhunelha ndebe. Nansho ikhandiri inothomeiya vachulhu ikiango, yaamwalhelheke onkhaye ari mpaani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu, nthuko inyu unothananiya umwalhieke mwaattuni, attu oone meetelho inyu oombone, wiira aavahe nthimicho Athumwaninyu ari wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o Malhehero a ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Nhaanyihere wiira kiwiilhe uchiichiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni ikano cha anamilhohi. Akiwiilhe uchiichiha, nansho uhimiechesha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani we ikekhiaye wiira mpaka irimu ni ilhapo vanohalha aya uvira, khiiwo inakhalhaka inukuta imoka ama vakittu vakani chinene nhina Malhehero a ashinna Musa, vanohalha uwukulhiya mpaka onkhaye vanohalha aya uphiyelha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paahi etu, ntu riyoothe nolhoha uhiya nlheheriyo nimoka nikani upwaha onkhaye, ni weettuchiha attu akina apange chiicho, yoyo nowa waalhakelhiya mwankani nhina Imwene yo wiirimu. Nansho nolhoha uvara ni weettuchiha attu akina yoyo nookhalha mulhupalhe mu Imwene yo wiirimu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi kinouhimeriani, ikekhia inyu yaahipwaheke ulhoka wa Amafarisayo, ni attu owiittuchiha Malhehero khannowa mwaakelha mena nhina Imwene yo wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo urushiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nhomalha wiiwa wiira attu o khalhayi yeerelhiye, “Nhiive, nolhoha wiiva nohukumulhiya.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho mii vano kinouhimeriani wiira, ntu riyoothe nonthunanelha mmuchi awe yoyo arweehiye umilhatuni ahukumulhiye. Ntu nolhoha umwiirelha munnawe, Khannolhoka inyu! Yoyo arweehiyeke umilhatuni wulhupalhe, ni uyo hechatameriha umooroni Ujehannamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwarweehaka isadaka umadhubahuni uno muupuwelhaka wiira nhima inyu rii ni nlhove ni inyu, <verse number="24" style="v"/>nhiyeke isadaka inyu umadhubahuni nhokolhieke thoko mwamwiwanane nhima inyu, vavawo mmweeke tho ni ukumiha ishaani inyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mmwiiwananeke ntu muntekenlhe inyu nhinaphiya umilhatuni. Mwaphiyaka wowo nhineewanana nowa uuhelhani mmathathani mwa attu o uhukumulha, ni ayo anowaavaha manyaasikari anaattuka attu, mwattukiye. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye, wowo khannokhuma mpaka nholhiva nchurukhu wo umalhihera nlhatu winyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o mwaha wo ishembwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nheewa wiira attu yeerelhiye ‘Nhilhuve!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nansho mii kinouhimeriani, ntu nommweha nthiyana wonthanana, honlhuvana munrimani mwawe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paahi etu niitho ninyu no wiimonono nottekihakani, nkhulheke ni urihelha uwo shoro! Nambaya chinene uhikhalha ni itturi imoka mwiiruttuni mwinyu, iruttu yonkhaye ihiwe yaarihiya umooroni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ni moono inyu wo wiimonono wo uttekihakani, ntupulheke ni urihelha utayi! Nambaya mpoterihe itturi imoka mwiiruttuni mwinyu, iruttu inyu ihiwe yaatikhelhiya yonkhaye umooroni Ujehannamu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo umwalhaana nthelhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Tho, yaheeriya wiira, ‘ntu naahiya ahanu awe, aavaheke italaka yo umwalhaana.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho mii kinouhimeriani wiira ntu aahiyaka ahanu awe ni waavaha italaka yo umwalhaana vahirii nlhatu no ulhavalhava, haalhavalhaviha, ni ntu nottuna waathelha ni uyo holhavalhava.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo ulhupelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Tho nheewa wiira attu o khalhayi yeerelhiye ‘Nhilhiyalhe ulhupelha winyu, nansho ntimiriheke naapo ninyu wa Athithi.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nansho mii kinowirelhani nna, nhilhupelhe irimu, ukhalhawaya phi ihiche ya Nlhuku, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mena wo ilhapo, ukhalhawaya phi nipuro chineesha aya mieto chaya, mena wo Uyerusalemu, ukhalhawaya phi iwani ya Amwene olhupalhe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nhilhupelhe wo muru inyu, ukhalhawaya khannoria uthathusha ikharari inyu imoka ukhalha ipwii ama yooripa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mweeraka ‘Eiyo’ ikhalheke ‘Eiyo!’ Mweeraka ‘Kachihena’ ikhalheke ‘Kachihena.’ Ittu iriyoothe yo upwaha yayo inokhuma wa Nakare.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo uhokolhoshera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Nheewa yeeriye wiira ‘Niitho wo niitho ni niino wo niino.’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nansho mii kinouhimeriani wiira nhinhokolhoshere ntu no upangelhani cho uhilhoka. Ntu riyoothe o watakani nrama no wilhopwana, munrukunushelheke nikina no wiimushi nno. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ni ntu riyoothe o urwehakani uhukumulhiyani athananaka uuthurulhani mwinjiro winyu, munhiyereke awieke ni nikoti ninyu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ni ntu okhanyererihakani wiira munkushere nsigo awe nkwaha wo imaili imoka, munrwaaneke imaili pilhi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ntu noovekelhani ittu mummaheke, nowaashimani ittu mmwaashimeke.</para>
  <para style="s">Waattuna amalhaponi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Nheewa wiira yeeriye, ‘Munttuneke mmuchi inyu ni waavenga amalhaponi inyu.’ <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nansho mii kinolhelhani wiira mwaattuneke amalhaponi inyu ni waalhapelhelha attu anowomolhani mwaattiva, <verse number="45" style="v"/>mmwe mwaakhalha ashaana a Athumwaninyu ari wiirimu. Ukhalhawaya yayo phi naapharelhiha nchuwa naya attu o uhilhoka ni attu o nrima woombone ni waarupelha ipulha attu oombone ni attu o unanara mirima. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Chani Nlhuku nolhoha uttuvani ittu yaani wo waattuna attu anouttunani vekha aya? Ata attu anolhiviha ikhodi aneera chiicho! <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mwaakohachaka ashilhoko inyu vekha aya, chani vavawo nhopanga ittu yo ulhoka? Ata attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku ni ayo anopanga chiichammo! <verse number="48" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkhalheke o wiiraniha thoko Athumwanihu o wiirimu chiri aya!</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o waavaha attu ahirina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mwiichinanelheke nhiwe mwaapanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku vaattuni, mwoonachiye ni attu. Mwapangaka chiicho vaattuni, khiiwo inohalha inyu uttuvelhiya ni Athumwaninyu o wiirimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Paahi etu vanommaha inyu ittu ntu hirina ittu nhiikhuwelhelhe, nhipange thoko chineera aya anafiki mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni mmaphironi. Aneera chiicho wiira yoonachiye ni attu avahiye nthimicho. Ikekhia kinouhimeriani, yayo ahomalha upochera uttuviya waya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nansho inyuva vanommaha inyu ntu novekelha ittu, mpangeke wo munrimani mwinyu ata ampwana inyu ahichuwelhe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mummaheke wo nivitho. Ni Athithi anoona nnivithoni anowuttuvani.</para>
  <para style="s">Wiittuchihiya ulhapelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Vanolhapelha inyu, nhipange thoko anafiki! Anottuna ulhapelha aneemenlhe mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni mmaphironi wiira yoonachiye ni attu. Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, yayo ahomalha uttuvelhiya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nansho inyu vanolhapelha inyu, mwiittelheke mpaani, ni waalhapelha Athithi inyu ahinoonia. Athithi anoona chiivinthe anowuttuvani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Vanolhapelha inyu, nhipwapwache malhove thoko attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, anaanyihera wiira milhuku chaya chinowewelhelha wo nlhatu no malhove menchi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nhilhikaane thoko yayo. Athumwaninyu ahochuwelha anohalha inyu uthanana nhinaalhepelha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vano etu, iphiro inothananiya inyu wulhumacha vanolhapelha inyu phi ilha, mwiireke</para>
  <para style="q">‘Athithi nri Wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q">Nchina ninyu nithimichiye,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imwene inyu iwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Chinothanana inyu, chipangieke velhaponi va thoko wiirimu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nnivaheke lhelho cholhia chihu cho kila nihuku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nnihiyerereke uwonya wihu,</para>
  <para style="q">Thoko ni hii chineera ihu waahiyerera attu annittekelha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nhinihelhe mu ulhikachiyani</para>
  <para style="q">Nansho nnoopolheke ni ulhe o mitheko cho unanara ulhe.’</para>
  <para style="q">(Ukhalhawaya umwene uri wawinyu ni machiri ni nthimicho wo mahuku o uhimalha. Aye.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Ukhalhawaya mwaahiyereraka attu milhatu chaya, Athumwaninyu o wiirimu anouhiyererani uwonya ni inyu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho mwaahahiyerereke attu akina milhatu chaya, ni ayo Athumwaninyu khanouhiyererani uwonya winyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o mwaha wo uttuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Vanottuka inyu, nhoonihe ichuku wiitho thoko anafiki chineera aya. Yayo anokhunyanyihacha wiitho yoonachiye ni attu wiira ahottuka. Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, yayo ahomalha uttuviya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vanottuka inyu mwiihikeke makhura mmuruni, nkhucheke wiitho ni uvacha ikharari chinyu, <verse number="18" style="v"/>attu akina ahichuwelhe wiira nhottuka. Nansho ichuwaniaka tu ni Athumwaninyu ahinoonia. Ni ayo Athumwaninyu anoona chiivinthe, anowuttuvani.</para>
  <para style="s">Nikhupi no wiirimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Nhiicheshere nhakhu velhaponi va, vari ni ucheshe ni nrenje unotanganya ni attu owiiya aphomolhaka inupa ni wiiya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho mwiicheeshereke nhakhu inyu wiirimu, ucheshe ni nrenje uhinooria aya utanganyacha ni attu owiiya khanooria uphomolha ni wiiya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya vari nhakhu inyu ni nrima inyu phi nohalha aya ukhalha vavawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Nthuko wo iruttu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Miitho phi nthuko wo iruttu. Miitho inyu akhalhaka makumi iruttu yonkhaye iri voonene. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho miitho inyu akhalhaka mareta iruttu yonkhaye inohalha ukhalha mwo unanara mwiipiphini. Nthuko uri mwiiruttuni mwinyu wakelhiyaka ipiphi paahi etu, yeyo ipiphi iyo iri yo woopiha chinene!</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhuku ni nhakhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Khaawo ntu nokhalha ipotta yo uvara ntheko wa attu elhi ukhalhawaya nohalha unttuna mmoka ni unvenga nkina, nokhalha o ukhulhuvelhiya wa ntu mmoka, ni uhikulhuvelhiya wa ntu nkina uyo. Khannoria ukavihera mitheko cha Athithi Nlhuku ni nhakhu vamoka.</para>
  <para style="s">Nipampa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Phi iyo inouhimeriakani wiira, nhikhalhe ni nipampa no yolhia ni cho uwuriya chinothananiya ni ukumi inyu wiira nlhame, mena no ikuwo cho uwara mwiiruttuni. Chani ulhia yolhia phi ulhama? Ni iruttu chani ngati phi thempe upwaha ikuwo? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwooneke ashinuni, khanaalha imbeyu, khanokhungura mena khanoshunga nnikhupini, nansho Athithi o wiirimu anowaalhiha. Chani mwaattiva kanhiwena o ulhoka waapwaha ashaanuni? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Phi mpani munlhokoni mwinyu ri ni nipampa ninchi nooria wuncherera mahuku o ulhokelha wawe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ni nlhatuni no ukhalha ni nipampa no ikuwo? Mwooneke ituva cho mmatimani chineera aya wookonda, khachinopanga mitheko mena utiva. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira anakhalhaka Amwene Naselemani anene ni upuha waya wonkhaye, khayaapante uwara ikuwo cho nthimicho thoko ituva imoka aya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nlhuku phi nokondiha thoko chiicho mathaakhuru o mmatani arii lhelho ahawo meelho ahorihiya vamooroni. Chani khanoria uwarihani mwaattiva wo upwaha chinene? Mwaattiva, chani woonaka mirima chinyu chiri chikani?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Paahi etu nhikelhiye nipampa ‘Ninohalha ulhiani? Ama ninohalha uwuriani? Ama ninohalha uwarani!’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo chinohuvelhiya ni attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku. Athithi inyu o wiirimu ahochuwelha wiira nnothanana chechiyo chittu chonkhaye chiyo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nansho, mwaatti mwaavieke thoko umwene wa Nlhuku ni chittu chinothananiya ni chiyo chonkhaye nnowunchereriya. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Paahi etu nhikhelhiye nipampa wo nlhatu no meelho, meelho nihawo nihuku naya. Uthemwa wo nihuku nimoka unowuthoshani wo nenno nihuku nno.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Waahukumulha akina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nhaahukumulhe attu akina nhiwe ni inyu mwaahukumulhiya ni Nlhuku, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya chinohalha inyu waahukumulha attu akina phi chiichammo ni inyu chinohalha inyu uhukumulhiya. Ni uphimelhiya thoko yayo nnaaphimelha inyu attu ayo, Nlhuku phi nohalha awe uphimelhani. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnooria chani woona ikokholha nniithoni mwa nhima inyu uno nhoonaka nipattu niri nniithoni mwinyu mwaanene? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ama inoriacha chani umwiirelha nhima inyu, ‘Munna nkankani kuuthamiheni ikokholha nniithoni mwinyu,’ uno mwaanene nhithamihaka nipattu nniithoni mwinyu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Anafiki inyu! Nthamiheke thoko nipattu nirii nniithoni mwinyu, vavawo phi nohalha inyu wooria uthamiha ikokholha irii nniithoni mwa nhima inyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Nhaavahe ashipwa chittu chitakatifu ahiwe arukunuwaka ni ulhumani mwaanene. Mena nhirihelhe nhakhu inyu nkulhuweni ahiwe anyikalhachaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Uvekhelha, waavia ni uhodisha vankhorani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nvekelheke nnoovahiya, mwaavieke nnoopatta, nhodisheke vankhorani nnoohulhelhiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe novekelha noovahiya, ni ntu riyoothe naavia noopatta ni uyo nohodisha, vankhorani noohulhelhiya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chani haawo ntu riyoothe naangoro munlhokoni mwinyu, nommaha nlhuku mwaamwanawe vanovekelha awe nkatte? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ama nommaha inwaa vanovekelha awe ihopa? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ata nhookhalharu attu o unanara mirima, nhochuwelha waavaha achishaana inyu chittu choombone. Malhehero Athumwanihu o wiirimu anoopanga uthepa vavawo anowaavaha chittu choombone attu anaavekelha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Chittu chonkhaye chinothanana inyu mpangelhiye ni attu ni inyu mwaapangelheke ni ayo chiichammo. Yayo phi Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni ikano cha anamilhohi.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhako wo uyevayeva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nkelheke wo uvira nlhako wo uyevayeva ukhalhawaya iphiro inokelha uhinlhoka iri yo khanuwa ni nlhako wo ukelha ulhakalhihiyani uwo uri wo khanuwa ni ayo anovira yoyo nlhako uyo ari enchi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho iphiro inoholhelha muukumini iri yo uyevayeva ni attu anooria uvira yoyo nlhako uyo kheechinve.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwiri unochuwaniaa wo maphepu unemma aya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luk 6:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mwiichinanelheke ni anamilhohi o woothacha, anooweelhani ooniaka wo vathe thoko ikhondoro, nansho nhina miichi cho uchacha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nnowaachuwelha wo mitheko chaya. Chani attu anowooria urukulha izabibu mmiiwani ama ittini munrokani? Mena! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Paahi etu mwiri wookonda phi nemma maphepu oombone ni mwiri wo uhikonda uneema maphepu o unanara. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwiri wookonda khunooria wiimma maphepu o uhilhoka ni mwiri wo uhikonda khunemma maphephu oombone. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwiri unemma maphepu o unanara unookakhiya ni upahiya vamooroni. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi etu nnowa waachuwelha anamilhohi o woothacha wo mitheko chaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Akuuchuwenlheni mwaatti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Kahiwe kila ntu mena nokiirelha ‘Thithi, thithi’ nohalha ukelha Imwene yo wiirimu yaahikalhe alhe anopanga chinthanana aya Athithi ari wiirimu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Attu enchi anowa nenno nihuku no uhukumulhiya nno yeeraka, ‘Thithi, Thithi! Wo nchina ninyu nahohimiacha nttenga inyu ni wo nchina ninyu nahoomolha mashoka o unanara ni upanga cho ushangiha chinchi.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vavawo kinowa weerelha ‘Wo ikekhiaye akuuchuwenlheni mwaattiva. Nthame va inyu mwaatti o uwonya va!’</para>
  <para style="s">Atheki elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Vavawo ntu neewa malhove aka ni uvarechesha no ulhikaanihiya ni ntu o irusho aathekilhe inupa awe vamwalhani. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ipulha nkayaarupa ni miolhoko nkachaachara ni iphioo yo machiri nkayaawuka ni inupa kayaatikhinyelhe ukhalhawaya yaathekiye vamwalhani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nansho ntu riyoothe neewa malhove aka wo uhivarechesha nolhikaanihiya ni nthirikhi aathekilhe inupa awe vanhaavani. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ipulha yarupeke miolhoko nkachaachara ni iphioo yo machiri nkayaawuka nkayaakakha inupa iyo nkayaawulhuwa wo nkhito!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ikuru cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo nlhoko wa attu uyo nkawoomiya uwanoni wo meettuchiho eetuchiha awe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya kheetuchiha thoko owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa cheera aya, nansho eettuchiha wo ikuru.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamilha ntu o makutulha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu akhuruweke umwaakoni milhoko chinchi cha attu chahonttwara. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka o makutulha nkaawa wa Yesu, nkaakhoroma eeraka, “Thithi mwattunaka nnookilhamiha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkookolha moono nkammara eeraka, “Kinothanana nlhameke etu.” Wo uhipicha nkaalhama makutulha awe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha “Nhinhimerie ntu riyoothe. Nansho nrweeke mweechoniheke wa attu opochera ishaani ni ukumiha isadaka thoko chinohimia aya malhehero a ashinna Musa uhimiechesha wiira nholhama.”</para>
  <para style="s">Upisha nrima wa nholhelhi mmoka Nrumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu vaakelha awe iwani yo Ukapenaumu nholhelhi mmoka o weemelhelha manyaasikari ahowa ni unlhepelha <verse number="6" style="v"/>nkeera, “Thithi, karumiya aka ri vanlhilhini nreta hoririyacha iruttu nowereiya chinene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Kinoowa unlhamihani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, mii akiphwanelhiye wiira inyu nkelhe unupani waka. Nansho nromolheke nlhove tu namitheko aka noolhama. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya, ni mii kirii ntu kinowehiya ni mamulaka a attu akina, kikhalhanaka ikuru wa anamitheko. Kamwiirelhaka mmoka, ‘Urweeke!’ Khurwaaka. Kamwiirelhaka nkina, ‘Nkaawa va,’ khuwaaka. Nkina, kamwirelhaka ‘Upangeke ilha!’ Khupangaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu eeweke chiicho, nkaashanga chinene nkaahimeria attu anttwara ayo, “Kinohimia wo ikekhiaye wiira, akinapatta umwoona ntu riyoothe mu Israeli ri ni nrima thoko yolha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kinouhimeriani wiira attu enchi anoowa ukhuma unosha nchuwa ni akina uneelha nchuwa, akhalhaka vakaraamuni vamoka ni Aburahimu, Naisaka, ni Nayakhobo urii Imwene yo wiirimu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho alhe yaathananiye ukhalha muyoyo Umwene uyo anookakhelhiya vathe wiipiphini, uri nunlhiho ni ukhura miino.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amalheke, Yesu nkaamwirelha nholhelhi a manyaasikari Nrumi uyo, “Nrweeke uwani, ni iyo ikhalhekeke thoko mwinre inyu wo uvara nrima.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni yeyo isaa iyo karumiya awe nkaalhama.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha areta enchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaphiya uwani u Napeturo, wowo nkaaphwanya ahokohi aya Napeturo anari areta vanlhilhini, awereiyaka iruttu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkaavara moono, ureta nkawaalhama. Nkayeemelha, nkayaachokholha waaterekhelha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Uchechilho, Yesu nkaawiheriya attu enchi aari ni mashoka o unanara. Ni uyo wo wulhumacha nlhove tu, nkoomolhacha mashoka ni waalhamiha areta onkhaye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Aapanga chiicho utimiriha malhove yaahimie ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya wiira, “Yoyo howia uhichooria wihu, nkaakusha mareta ihu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iphiro yo unttwara Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu vonne awe nlhoko wa attu ananrukurenrie, nkeerelha owiittucha awe arwee ukhopelhelhe nttiya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero amoka nkanrwelha eeraka, “Owiittuchiha, ni mii kinouttwarani uriwoothe unohalha inyu urwaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Anancheto ahanaa milhiwi chaya ni ashanuni o uchulhu ahanaa iphuuru urimu, nansho Mwaana a Ntu kharina nipuro no waathalhelha muru awe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ntu owiittucha nkina munlhokoni mwawe nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Thithi, nkihiye thoko kirwee kaavithe athumwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nkittwareke mii, mwaahiyeke attu akhwilhe avitheke mitembo chaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nootondoviha iphioo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawelha nkalhavani, owiittucha awe nkayanttwara. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vahipincheru iphioo yo machiri nkayaawukelha munttiyani, maashi nkaakelha nkalhavani. Nansho Yesu aari narumpe ikhove. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayanrwelha, nkayammusha yiiraka, “Thithi, nnoopolhe, ninootitimira!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva o nrima mwankani, chani nnoovani?” Nkeemelha nkaachachera iphioo ni maashi, nttiya nkanaamaalha shiriri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Attu nkayoomiya uwanoni yiiraka, “Phi ntu ani yolha? Ata iphioo ni nttiya chinomwiiwelhelha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu elhi o mashoka o unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe nkayaaphiya ukhopelhelhe nttiya no Ugalilaya wi iwani yo Uagadara, wowo attu elhi yaavariye ni mashoka o unanara nkayankumaana akhumachaka umahiyeni. Yayo attu ayo yaari o woopiha chinene, mena khaawo ntu aavira yeyo iphiro iyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayaachokholha unyakulhacha yeeraka, “Urinani ni hii, uwe Mwaana a Nlhuku? Chani uwilhe unitwarusha nihuku nihu nihinaya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vakhiviru ni vavawo vaari vahuwiyaka miphingo cho ikulhuwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mashoka o unanara ayo nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira, “Mwanoomolhaka, nnihiyeke nakelheke mphingo wo ikulhuwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nrwaacheke etu.” Vavawo nkayaakhuma attu o mashoka alhe, nkayaakelha nkulhuweni. Miphingo chonkhaye cho kulhuwe nkachaakhuruwelha uhito, nkachaakelha mmaashini nkachaakhwacha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Attu yaahuwa ikulhuwe ayo nkayaattawacha nkayaarwaa, wowo nkayaahimiacha mmamatani chittu chonkhaye chaakumelhenlhe, ni mwaha wa attu o mashoka elhi alhe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Paahi attu onkhaye o yeyo iwani iyo yahokhuma ni unrwelha Yesu, yamwooneke nkayanlhepelha wiira athame mwiilhaponi mwaya mmo.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu oririya iruttu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawelha nkalhavani nkaalhapuwa nttiya nkaaphiya iwani yo uwannyawe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayaawacha attu anakunshe nkori wankushilhe aya ntu mmoka oheeta. Yesu vonne awe nrima aya, nkaamwirelha ntu oheeta uyo, “Upisheke nrima, mwaamwanaka! Uhohiyereriya uwonya wawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachukulhacha ashineneru wiira, “Yolha ntu ulha nonlhava Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha ichuku chaya chiyo nkeera, “Nlhatu waani wo uchukulhacha mmamirimani mwinyu chittu cho uhilhoka chiyo? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Varenre vayi, umwiirelha, ‘uwonya winyu uhohiyereriya’ ama wiira ‘wunkweke, weeteke?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi etu kinothanana nchuwelheke wiira Mwaana a Ntu hanaa ikuru velhaponi yo uhiyerera uwonya wa attu.” Vavawo nkaamwirelha ntu oheeta ulhe, “Wunkweke etu, ukusheke ikori awo urweeke uwani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ntu oheeta ulhe nkeemelha nkaarwa uwannyawe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye munlhokoni mmwe yooneke yayo, yahoomiya uwanoni ni woova, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku avanhee attu ikuru thoko yeyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Namatayo anowiihaniya ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ahothama vavawo. Vaari awe mphironi ahomwoona ntu mmoka eehaniya Matayo nakhanlhe wi inupa mwaalhivelhiya ikhodi. Yesu nkaamwiirelha “Nkittware.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni uyo nkeemelha ni unttwara Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkayaakhalha etu, vaari awe mpaani unupani u Namatayo alhiaka yolhia, attu yaalhiviha ikhodi enchi ni attu o uwonya yahorwaa nkayaakalha vamoka ni Yesu ni owiittucha awe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Amafarisayo yooneke chiicho, nkayaakoha owiittucha awe, “Chani woonaka owiittuchiha inyu anolhia vamoka ni attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu veewilhe awe nkaakhulha eeraka, “Attu akumi khanaavia abwana mganga ihikhalhe areta phi naavia abwana mganga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi etu mwiittucheke yayo malhove aneera ayo, ‘Ikiriri phi nothanana aka, mena kuhiwe isadaka ya ashinama.’ Akiwilhe weehana attu o nrima woombone nansho attu o uwonya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo uttuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru, owiittucha a Nayohana obatiiza yahommwelha Yesu nkayankoha, “Hii ni Amafarisayo va ninottuka venchi, nansho chani woonaka owiittucha inyu khanottuka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, attu alhalheiye wa arusini anowooria uttuka uno abwana arusi anari vavawo? Mena, kuhiwe! Nansho ikatema inowa uphiya abwana arusi vanohalha aya uthama vavawo, yeyo ikatema iyo attu phi nohalha aya uttuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ikuwo yo khalhayi kinotottelhiya imbaati ikumi, ukhalhawaya yeyo imbaati iyo inototokora ikuwo yo khalhayi iyo ni wuncherera vathanlhe vawo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mena ntumpa wo wulhuvalha khunohelhiya idivai yoochasha. Yakhalhaka chiicho mwaapu unophwiaa ni idivai nkayaarihiaa. Nansho attu anhelha idivai yoochasha nhina mitumpa chikumi, ni chopilhi ntumpa ni idivai chinoolhama chonkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwalhi a nholhelhi ni nthiyana ammanre ikuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe olhumachaka yayo, nholhelhi mmoka a Ayahudi nkaawa, nkankhoromelha ni wulhumacha eeraka, “Mwalhi aka hokhwa naanano vaa, nansho chonte nngwe mwamweeshere moono, ni uyo noolhama.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe nkayaathama nkayanttwara.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Opani amoka, aari awereiyaka ireta yo ukhuma iphome, nchorochoro iyaakha khumi ni pilhi, ahonttwara Yesu vatulhi vawe, nkaavara ikuwo awe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Aapangilhe chiicho opuwelhaka munrimani eeraka wiira, “Kavaraka tu ikuwo awe kinoolhama.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarukunuwa nkoona, nkeera, “Mwaamwanaka, wiilhipiheke nrima ao uhoolhamiha!” Opani ayo nkayaalhama yeyo isaa iyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yamalheke Yesu nkaakelha mpaani mwa yoyo nholhelhi uyo. Oneekeru attu aamopa mpeta ni attu onlhacha, <verse number="24" style="v"/>nkeera, “Nthamache va attu onkhaye! Mwalhi ulha kanakhwa, howiraka urupa!” Attu yaamwiwilhe ayo nkayanthiacha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi etu attu athameke, Yesu nkaakelha mpaani waarumpe awe mwalhi, nkammara moono, ni uyo nkeemelha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nenno nlhove nno nkanaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu elhi ohoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathama vavawo, ni vaari awe arwaaka, attu ohoona elhi yahonttwara anyakulhachaka yiiraka, “Mwaana a Adaudi, nnoonelhe ikiriri!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu akelheke mpaani ohoona elhi alhe nkayanrwelha, ni uyo nkaakoha, “Chani? Nnoorumelhelha wiira kinowooria uulhamihani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni ayo nkayaamwaakhulha “Eiyo Thithi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vavawo Yesu nkaakwakwanya miitho, nkeera “Ikhalheke thoko nrima inyu chinothanana aya!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Miitho aya nkayaapatakuwa. Yesu nkaamukacha wo uchacha eeraka, “Nhinhimerie ntu riyoothe ulha mwaha ulha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nansho yathamacheke nkayaavira awanelhihaka mwaha wo Yesu ilhapo yonkhaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu o uhulhumacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Attu vaarwacha aya umawannyaya, attu akina nkayanrwehelha Yesu ntu mmoka o uhulhumacha attukiye ni nshoka no unanara. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wo uhipicha mashoka ayo yomolhachiyeke, ntu o uhulhumacha uyo nkaachokholha wulhumacha tho. Nlhoko wa attu nkawoomiya uwanoni nkayeera “Khaninapacha woona mwaha thoko yolha mu Israeli mu!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nansho Amafarisayo nkayaahalha yiiraka, “Noomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo nholhelhi o mashoka o unanara.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noowonelha attu ikiriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu aheetakachera iwani chonkhaye ni ittoko chaya ettuchihaka mu inupa chaya cho unlhapelha Nlhuku. Aari ettuchihaka Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni ulhamiha mareta onkhaye ni uhuperia wo kila iphiro. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Paahi ooneke attu milhoko wo milhoko, ahoonelha ikiriri ukhalhawaya yaari anoocheelhe chinene achariyaka ni nipampa thoko ikhondoro chihiri ni nshunga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vavawo nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Nlhaalha uri mwinchi, nansho anamitheko ari vakani. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Paahi etu mwaalhapelheke Athithi, anene nlhaalha yaawiihe anamitheko o uwa ukhungurani.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akarumiya khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu aheehana owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi, nkhaavaha ikuru yo woomolha mashoka o unanara ni waalhamiha attu ikwerere ni mareta onkhaye. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Machina aya akarumiya khumi ni elhi ayo phi alha, o upachera Nasimoni eehaniya Peturo ni ahima aya Naandorea, Nayakhobo ashaana a Nazebedayo, Nayohana nhima aya, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nafilipo, Nabatolomayo, Natomaso, Namatayo aalhiviha ikhodi, Nayakhobo ashaana a Naalufayo, ni Natadayo, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nasimoni o Ukaanani, ni Nayuda Isikariote anthuminhe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaaruma akarumiya khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaruma khumi ni elhi ayo ni waalhehera choo, “Nhirwee iwani cha attu ahiri Ayahudi, mena nhikelhe mmawani mwa Asamariya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nansho, nrweeke wa attu o inupa yo Israeli apotenre thoko ikhondoro chihiri ni nshunga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vanorwaa inyu mwettuchiheke wiira, ‘Umwene wo wiirimu uhatameria!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwaalhamiheke areta, mwaahihimusheke attu akhwilhee, mwaalhamiheke attu o makutulha, mwoomolheke mashoka. Nvahiye wo maphathi mwakumiheke wo maphathi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nhikushe mmirupani mwinyu idhahabu mena nchurukhu mena nchurukhu wo shaba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nhikushe nrupa wo uvekelhelha mphironi mena mwiinjiro wo nayelhi, mena iratu cho nayelhi mena ikopo. Ukhalhawaya namitheko hophwanelhiya malhivo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Vanophiya inyu vawani ama ittoko iriyoothe, mwamwaavieke mommo ntu nottuna upocherani, mwakhalheke vavawo mpaka vanohalha inyu uthama vawo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vanokelha inyu mpaani mwa ntu mweereke ‘Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka anenchi o yeyo inupa iyo anowupocherani mwaattiva, nhiyeke mpuha unolhapelha inyu ukhalhe ni ayo. Nansho yaahupocherekeni mwaattiva, paahi nhokolhosheke mpuha nnolhapelha inyu uyo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka inupa ama iwani khayopochenreni, paahi vanokhuma inyu yeyo inupa iyo au yeyo iwani iyo, ni ukukutta ntukurukhu nnyaani mwinyu ikhalheke phi iphiro yo waamuka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, Nihuku no Uhukumulhiya attu nno, ilhapo cho Usodoma ni Ugomora chinowa chaavilhelha ntwarusho, upwaha yeyo iwani iyo!</para>
  <para style="s">Uttwaruwa unowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mako 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mwiiweke! Vano mii, kinourumani mwaattiva thoko ikhondoro umiichini. Mpenyeke thoko inwaa, ni wiitimarikha thoko kaulha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwiichiinanelheke ni attu, ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaavariya ni urwehiya umilhatuni ni waatiya ikopo mmanupani mwaya mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nnoowa mwaarweehiya wa attu antawara ni wo mamwene, mwahimiecheshe Malhove Orera uwannyaya ni wa attu ahiri Ayahudi wo nlhatu waka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paahi etu, vanohalha aya urwehani mwaattiva umilhatuni vawo, nhikelhiye nipampa chinohalha inyu wulhumacha ama nlhove naani ninohalha inyu uhimiacha, ikatema yaphiyaka, nnoowa uvahiya ittu yo uhimia. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya malhove anohalha inyu wulhumacha ayo kahiwe awinyu, anowa ukhuma wa Iphumu ya Athithi inyu olhumachaka wo malhaku inyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Attu anowa waathumiha achihimaya eeviye, ni manyanaangoro anowa waathumiha achishaana aya, ni ashaana anowa wapitikulhelha manyanaangoro ni weevakacha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye anowa uuvengani wo nlhatu wo nchina naka. Nansho nohalha uvilhelha mpaka nihuku no umalhelha phi uyo nohalha woopolhiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mwavengiyaka iwani imoka, nttawelheke iwani ikina. Ikekhia kinouhimeriani kannomalhiha nkwaha inyu iwani chonkhaye cho Uisraeli Mwaana a Ntu hinaphiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Khaawo owiittucha naapwaha owiittuchiha awe, mena karumiya nompwaha mwanene ntheko awe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo ihothosha owiittucha ukhalha ni ikuru thoko owiittuchiha awe ni karumiya ukhalha thoko mwanene ntheko. Yakhalhaka aneehana anene imbumba ya Belzebuli, chani akina khaneehana wo machina o uhilhoka!</para>
  <para style="s">Anophwanelhiya Wooviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Wo chiichammo etu nhoove attu. Ittu ikhunelhiye inowa yaapatakulhiya, ni ittu ivithiye inowa uhumbukulhiya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Chinouhimeriakani mwaattiva mwiipiphini, nhimiacheke voonene, nlhove niiwilhe inyu naapiyaka mmweeke mwaahimiacha nneemenlhe vanchaarani. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nhoove attu aneeva iruttu nansho ahooriaka wiiva nnepa, nansho mmwooveke Nlhuku, nooria wiiva chonkhaye iruttu vamoka ni nnepa umooroni Ujehannamu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Athooche elhi anothumihiya wo isenti imoka, nansho khaawo ata mmoka nomora vathi Athithi inyu wo uhichuwelha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho uwaninyu mwaattiva, ata ikharari chinyu cho mmuruni chihaalhakelhiya chonkhaye. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nhoove etu, mwaattiva nri o ukhulhuvelhiya chinene waapwaha athooche enchi!</para>
  <para style="s">Unrumelhelha ni unkhota Moopolhi Kuristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Attu onkhaye anorumelhelha vaattuni wiira phi awaka, ni mii chiicho kinoowa kaarumelhelha wa Athumwanaka arii wiirimu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nansho ntu riyoothe nohalha ukikhota vaattuni, ni mii kinowa kankhota wa Athumwanaka ari wiirimu.</para>
  <para style="s">Umwalhaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Nhaanyihere wiira kiwiihilhe mpuha velhaponi. Mena, akiwanne mpuha, nansho uphanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kiwiihilhe umwalhaana ntu ni athumwanawe, mwalhi ni anumwanawe, mmokohi ni ahokohi awe, <verse number="36" style="v"/>amalhaponi inyu anowa ukhalha phi attu o mmanupani mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Ntu naattuna athumwanawe ama anumwanawe chinene ukhiphwaha mii, yoyo khamphwanelhiya ukhalha owiittucha aka, ni ntu naattuna achishaana awe ashilhophwana ni ashithiyana chinene ukiphwaha mii yoyo khaphwanelhiye ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ntu hinokusha nsalaaba awe ni ukittwara inyaa chaka khanooria ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ntu novarechesha ukumi awe unonkulhuphuwa, nansho ntu hinovarechesha ukumi awe wo nlhatu waka nowa upatta tho.</para>
  <para style="s">Nttuvo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mako 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe no upocherani mwaattiva nokipochera mii, ni uyo nokipochera mii naapochera akirumilhe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ntu nompochera namilhohi a Nlhuku wo nlhatu no ukhalha namilhohi a Nlhuku, nowa upochera nttuvo no namilhohi. Ni ntu riyoothe nompochera ntu o nrima woombone wo nlhatu wo urera nrima, nowa upatta nttuvo no utawara. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, ntu riyoothe nohalha ummaha mmoka aya alha ashinkani alha nkawo wo maashi o uririya wo nlhatu wo ukhalha owiittucha aka, we ikeekhene khanowa aathuwiya nttuvo nawe.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akarumiya a Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke waalhehera owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi malhehero, ahothama vavawo nkaarwa uwiittuchihani ni uhimiacha Malhove Orera iwani cho vakhiviru.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nayohana Obatiiza veewilhe aya ujeerani mwaha wo chittu chinopangacha awe Kuristo, nkaaruma owiittucha aya wa Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkayaarwaa unkohani yeeraka, “Nnihimerieke, ana inyuva phi ntu anhimmie aya Nayohana wiira haawo nowa, ama nimmweherereke ntu nkina?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhokolhieke mwaahimerieke Nayohana chittu chiwilhe inyu ni woona, <verse number="5" style="v"/>attu ohoona anowoona tho ni attu oheeta anoweeta ni attu o makutulha anoolhamihiya, attu ohiiwa anowiiwa, attu akhwilhe anoohihimushiya ni attu amashikini anoohimeriya Malhove Orera. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ahoreeriya attu ahiri ni nipampa ni mii!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ikatema owiittucha a Nayohana vaathamanche aya, Yesu ahochokholha waahimeria milhoko cha attu mwaha unaacha Nayohana eeraka, “Vaarwelhe inyu u Nayohana uthakoni ulhe mwaakhenlhe woonani? Chani mwaarweelhe woona nthalhe utikhinyiyaka ni iphioo? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwaakenlhe woonani? Mwaakenlhe umwoona ntu warenlhe ikuwo cho uphwanelha? Attu anowara ikuwo cho uphwanelha anokhalha mmanupani mwa mamwene. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkihimerieke mwaakenlhe woonani? Umwoona namilhohi? Eiyo, nansho nkamwoona chittu cho unthepa namilhohi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ukhalhawaya Nayohana phi ayo ahimiachiye ni Malhove Matakatifu, ‘Nlhuku heera, Kinonruma karumiya aka oholhelheni, akooroshe iphiro inyu.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wo ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani wiira Nayohana Obatiiza phi olhupalhe umpwaha ntu riyoothe aapantte uyaria. Nansho ulhe rii mwankani chinene mu Imwene yo wiirimu ulhe phi mulhupalhe waapwaha Nayohana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukhuma ikatema Nayohana Obatiiza vaahimianche aya nttenga mpaka nna, Umwene wo wiirimu uri uttwaruwaka chinene, ni attu o machiri alhikachaka uthurulha wo machiri. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpaka Nayohana vawiilhe aya, meettuchiho onkhaye a anamilhohi ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa inoolhumacha mwaha wo Umwene, <verse number="14" style="v"/>ni inyu mwarumelhelhaka nttenga aya, Nayohana phi Naeliya, aalhoheriye uwa waya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ri ni maaru eeweke etu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, kinohalha ulhikaaniha ni ittu yaani ilha iyari ya alha mahuku ilha? Attu aya ari thoko ashimirawo anokhalhacha mmapuwani nnopangiya maronda. Nkutiro mmoka waakhuwelhelhaka akhunanaya, <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Mwaatti nahowopelhani ikoma, nansho khamwenne! Naheepa ichipo cho nunlhiho nansho khamwonlhilhe!’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nayohana vaawilhe aya, ahottuka mena khaawunrie idivai, ni mwaatti nkamweera, ‘Ri ni nshoka no unanara!’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu wiilhe awe, noolhia ni uwuria, mwaattiva nkamweera, ‘Mummweheke ulha ntu ulha! Ntu o umenyekha ni uhapalhiya, mpwana aya attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya!’ Ata chiicho etu, irusho cha Nlhuku chinowonihiya wiira chiri choombone wo ulhikaana ni mitheko chaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwani cho uhirumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachokholha waakuphulhacha attu o mmawani mwaapannge awe cho ushangiha nansho khayaarumelhenlhe ni ukhoroma uhiya uwonya waya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu attu o Ukorazini! Nhothapana inyu attu o Ubethsaida! Ukhalhawaya cho ushangiha chipangiye uwaninyu chikaapangiye Utiro ni Usidoni, attu o wowo yammwara majuniya ni wiihika ituura wooniha wiira ahokhoroma ni uhiya uwonya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa wo attu o Utiro ni attu o Usidoni uvilhelha ntwarusho uupwahani mwaattiva! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ni inyu Nakapenaumu! Chani nnothanana wiiwelhiha mwaanene wiirimu? Nnoowa mwaawulhusheriya unaminepa etu! Ukhalhawaya, ikaari cho ushangiha chipangiye uwaninyu chikaapangiye Usodoma, yeyo iwani iyo yanlhokelha mpaka nna. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa wo attu o ilhapo yo Usodoma uvilhelha ntwarusho nawe uupwahani inyuva!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mmweeke uwannyaka mmwe mweettuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu nkeera, “Thithi, Athithi o wiirimu ni o velhaponi! Kinoushukuruni ukhalhawaya nhaavitha attu o irusho ni attu anochuwelha alha malhove alha, nkamwaapatakulhelha attu ahiri ni irusho. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aye, Thithi, phinre aya wo uteelhani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Athithi ahokivaha chittu chonkhaye. Khaawo ntu nonchuwelha Mwaana yaahikalhe Athithi, mena khaawo naachuwelha Athithi ahikhalhe Mwaana, ni attu athanlhiye ni Mwaana nkaapatakulhelhiya. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mmweeke uwannyaka mwaattiva onkhaye, nnohuva ni ulhemelhiya misigo va, ni mii kinowiittuwihani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mwiittukeke nikonkwa naka, nkusheke irusho uwannyaka, ukhalhawaya mii kiri ntu o maalha ni wiitimarikha munrimani, ni inyu nnowa mwaapatta nipuro no wiittuwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya nikonkwa ninouvahakani mii niri no wolhwaa, ni nsigo kinouvahaakani khulhemenlhe uri pheruu.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:30">Ing'ope cho ulhima chittukiye nikonkwa </figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chinaacha Nihuku no Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, Yesu aari aviraka variyari imata cho ingaano Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Owiittucha awe aari anawolhiye ithalha, nkayontha machashi o ingaano ni ukhuura imbeyu chaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amafarisayo yooneke chiicho, nkayaamwirelha Yesu, “Mwooneke, owiittucha inyu anopanga ittu ichiichihiye ni Malhehero wiira ihipangiye Nihuku no Wiittuwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani mwaatti khannashoma chaapannge aya Adaudi vamoka ni ashikhunanaya vaawolhiye aya ithalha? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ahokelha Inupa ya Nlhuku, anene vamoka ni ashikhunanaya nkayaalhia mikatte chaakumihiye isadaka wa Nlhuku, inakhalhaka yaari ahittwaraka Malhehero a ashinna Musa wo ulhia chechiyo mikatte chiyo. Ukhalhawaya opochera ishaani vekha aya phi ahaachiichihiya ulhia. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ama chani, khanashoma nhina Malhehero wiira kila Nihuku no Wiittuwa attu opochera ishaani wi Inupa ya Nlhuku ari ahivaraka malhehero o Nihuku no Wiittuwa, nansho ahiirelhiyaka wiira ahotteka? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi, kinouhimeriani vano wiira hawo vaa ntu ri mulhupalhe upwaha Inupa ya Nlhuku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Ikiriri phi nothanana aka ni mena kihiwe isadaka ya ashinama.’ Mwachuwelhaka maana aya, khannaahukumulha attu ahittekilhe, <verse number="8" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu phi Mwanene Nihuku no Wiittuwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ntu o moono wo ririya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ahothama vavawo nkaakelha mu inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku, <verse number="10" style="v"/>mwaari awe ntu mmoka o moono wo uririyacha. Attu yaathanana umwootheria Yesu wiira hotteka, nkayankoha, “Chani, vahorera unlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu ikhondoro awe yawulhuwelhaka munlhikitini Nihuku no Wiittuwa, hinorwaa ni ukumiha munlhikitini mmo? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ntu phi ri o waalhakelhelhiya chinene upwaha ikhondoro! Paahi etu, khanichiichihiye umoopolha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amalheke nkaamwirelha ntu o moono wo uririyacha ulhe, “Wookolheke moono awo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkookolha, ni uyo nkawaakhalha nkumi tho, thoko moono nkina uyo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi etu Amafarisayo nkayaakhumacha vathe, nkayeewanana iphiro yo umwiiva Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Karumiya thanlhiye ni Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu vaachuwenlhe awe nenno nlhove nno, nkaathama vavawo vakitu vawo, ni attu enchi nkayanttwara. Nkaalhamiha areta onkhaye <verse number="16" style="v"/>nkaalhehera wiira ahaahimerie attu akina yayo malhove ayo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Enre chiicho wiira malhove aahimiye ni Nlhuku wo iphiro ya anamilhohi ashinna Isaya atimire,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ulha phi namitheko aka kinthanlhe aka,</para>
  <para style="q">Nonttuna aka, nokiteelhiha munrimani.</para>
  <para style="q">Kinonruma Iphumu aka vachulhu vawe,</para>
  <para style="q">Ni uyo nouhimeriani ihukumu aka wa ahiri Ayahudi onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Khanokhalha ni nikhanyerero mena khannyakulha,</para>
  <para style="q">Mena nlhove nawe khaninewaniaa mmaphironi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Khanontha nthalhe unyakathelhe,</para>
  <para style="q">Mena khantiphiha utambi unottuwa mwiishi.</para>
  <para style="q">Nolhokelha mpaka vanohalha awe uhimeriani ihukumu aka wa makosho onkhaye,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wo yoyo, makosho onkhaye anoowa aakhulhuvelha nchina nawe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Nakare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mako 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vavawo attu nkayanrwehelha Yesu ntu mmoka o hoona ni uhulhumacha aattukiye ni nshoka no unanara. Yesu nkanlhamiha, nkoolhumacha ni woona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nlhoko wa attu nkawoomiya uwanoni nkayeera, “Chani, nowooria ulha ukhalha mwaana a Adaudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Amafarisayo yeeweke ulha mwaha ulha, nkayeera, “Ulha ntu ulha noomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli, nholhelhi o mashoka o unanara.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachuwelha choopuwelha aya munrimani, nkeerelha, “Imwene iriyoothe imianelhe milhoko miilhi chihineewanana, yeyo khinolhokelha. Ni iwani iriyoothe ama nikosho niriyoothe nimianne milhoko milhoko chihineewanana inowulhuwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka umwene mmoka unaatakana ni umwene nkina wo machiri a Nakare, yoyo uhomalha umwalhaana unowulhuwa! <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nneera eti kinoomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli. Chani, owiittucha inyu etu anoomolha wo ikuru ya apani? Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo yayo phi nohalha uhukumulhani wiira nhotteka! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mena kahiwe Nakare, nansho Iphumu ya Nlhuku, phi nokivaha ikuru yo woomolha mashoka, uhimiechesha wiira, Umwene wa Nlhuku uhooweelhani mwaattiva.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Wo ikekhiaye, khaawo ntu nooria ukelha inupa ya ntu o machiri ni umwaakha nhakhu awe, mpaka anttukeke thoko ntu o machiri uyo, vavawo pinohalha awe wooria umwaakha nhakhu awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Ntu riyothe hirii vamoka ni mii yoyo nookivinga, ntu hinokikaviha ukhungura yoyo noomwarusha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ni mii kinouhimeriani wiira attu anoohiyereriya uwonya ni ulhava waya wonkhaye, nansho khanowa aahiyereriya nlhatu wo unruwana Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe noolhumacha nlhove no unlhava Mwaana a Ntu nohiyereriya, nansho ntu noolhumacha nlhove no unlhava Iphumu ya Nlhuku, khanohiyeriya, mwiilhaponi mu, mena ilhapo inowa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwiri ni maphepu aya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Wiira mpatte maphepu oombone nnothananiya waalha mwiri wookonda, mwiri waahikondeke, maphepu aya khanolhoka. Mwiri unochuwaniaa chineera aya wo wimma. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwaati iyari yo inwaa vaa nnohalha wooria chani uhimia malhove oombone uno nnari o uhilhoka? Ukhalhawaya malhaku a ntu anohimia chittu chiri munrimani. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ntu o nrima woombone noyara chittu choombone munhakhuni mwo chittu chawe choombone, ni ntu o uhilhoka noyara chittu cho uhilhoka munhakhuni mwawe mwo uhilhoka mmo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Paahi, kinouhimeriani nchuwelhe wiira, Nihuku no Uhukumulhiya attu, kila ntu nowa aakhulha vachulhu wo kila nlhove no uhikhalha marumbo noolhumanche awe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Malhove inyu phi nohalha uhukumulhani wiira nhotteka ama nhopanga moombone.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uvekelhiya woona cho ushangiha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mako 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yamalheke, owiittuchiha Malhehero akina ni Amafarisayo nkayanlhelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha, ninothanana woona mpangaka ithikineha.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwinre chani attu o uhilhoka o ulhuva va! Nnovekelha woona cho ushangiha? Mena! Ithikineha inohalha inyu woonihiya iri ya anamilhohi Nayona vekha aya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iphiro yaakhanlhe aya Nayona mahuku mararu uthana ni uhiyu mmirimani mwo nankumi, phi chiicho Mwaana a Ntu chinohalha awe ulhokelha unaminepa wuuthi ilhapo mahuku mararu uthana ni uhiyu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nihuku no Uhukumulhiya attu, attu o Uninavi anowa weemelha ni uhimia milhatu chinyu, ukhalhawaya ahomalha ukhoroma ni uhiya uwonya veewilhe aya nttenga u Nayona, ni mii vano kinouhimeriani wiira hawo mulhupalhe vaa naapwaha Nayona! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nihuku no Uhukumulhiya attu nno, Ahano o Usheeba anowa weemelha ni uhimiacha milhatu chinyu, ukhalhawaya yayo aheeta ukhuma utayi, nkaawa wiiwelhelha malhove o irusho a Naselemani. Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira vaa hawo ri mulhupalhe waapwaha Naselemani!</para>
  <para style="s">Uhokolhia wo nshoka no unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Nshoka no unanara vanoomolhiya aya mwiiruttuni mwa ntu, ninoovira naarukureriacha muuthakoni naaviaka vakittu vo wiittuwa. Naahooneke, <verse number="44" style="v"/>vavawo phi neera aya, ‘Kinohokolhiaa unupani waka.’ Kuhokolhiaka ni uphwanya inupa mwaari, inakwechiye ni urerihiya. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Phi norwaa aya ni waakusha mashoka makina saba o uhilhoka upwaha uyo, nkayaawacha ni ukhalha mwiiruttuni mwa ntu uyo. Vanomalha aya, ukumi wa ntu uyo vano unokhalha wo unanara upwaha khalhayi. Phi chiicho chinohalha aya ukhalha wa attu o uhilhoka a alha mahuku alha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Amuchi a Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:33-35">Mako 3:33-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu aari olhumachaka ni nlhoko wa attu ikatema anumwane ni ashilhoko awe vaawilhe aya. Nkayeemelhacha vathe, athananaka umulhumana. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Paahi ntu mmoka nkaamwirelha, “Nkoonani, anumwaninyu ni ashihima inyu arii vathe vawo, anothanana uwoonani.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Anumwanaka phi apani? Ashilhoko aka phi apani?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Amalheke nkaathonya owiittucha awe, nkeera, “Mwooneke alha va! Alha phi manyaanumwanaka ni ashilhoko aka! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe nopanga chinothanana aya Athithi ari wiirimu, yoyo phi nhima aka ni mwanrokoraka ni phi anumwanaka.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho na ntu naalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku, Yesu ahothama yeyo inupa iyo, nkaarwa ni ukhalha vachereshere nttiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Milhoko cha attu chanrukurenrie chaari chinchi mpaka nkaawelha nkalhavani, nkaakhalha. Attu nkayeemelha vachengweni, vachereshere nttiya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimiacha chittu chinchi wo ulhikaanihacha.</para>
  <para style="p">“Ahaawo ntu aarweelhe uumwaalhani nakhuwo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vaalha awe imbeyu mmatani, chahaawo chaamonre mphironi, ashanuni nkayaalhia. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chikina nkachaamora vamalhukuni vahirii ittaya yinchi. Nkaachamelha wo uhipicha ukhalhawaya ittaya yaari vakani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nansho nchuwa vaapharenlhe aya nkachaavia, ukhalhawaya mithithaari chaya khachethipenlhe, chahonyalha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Imbeyu chikina chaakorenlhe vamiiwani, nkachonnuwa nkachaatiyelhelhiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho imbeyu chikina chaamorenlhe vachaayirani, nkachaamelha rata, nkachemma, chikina inuku imia imoka, chikina makhumi sita ni chikina makhumi mararu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Rii ni maaru eeweke!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhatu no wulhumacha wo ulhikaaniha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkayaawa Owiittucha awe, nkayankoha, “Nlhatu waani no wulhumana attu wo malhikaaniho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva nhovaheriya uchuwelha chittu chivithiye cho Umwene wo wiirimu, nansho ayo khavaheriye. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu rina ittu nowunchereriya, ni ukhalhana chinchi, nansho ntu hirina ittu, ata ikani irinawe iyo ni iyo inookushiya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nlhatu nowulhumacha wo malhikaaniho niri wiira, anooweha nansho khaanona, anowiwelhelha nansho khaneewa, mena khanochuwelha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nihotimira vano nlhove ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Wo ikekhiaye alha attu alha wiiwa anowiiwa, nansho khanochuwelha inohimiya,</para>
  <para style="q">Uweha anoweha, nansho khanoona,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya irusho chaya chihophupuwalha,</para>
  <para style="q">Ahotiyelha maaru aya,</para>
  <para style="q">Ni utiyelhelha miitho aya.</para>
  <para style="q">Ihikaari chiicho miitho aya yaanoona,</para>
  <para style="q">Ni manyaru aya yaaneewa,</para>
  <para style="q">Mirima chaya chanchuwelha,</para>
  <para style="q">Ni ayo anokirukunuwelha mii, neera Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">Ni mii kaanalhamiha.’</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Nansho nhoreeriya mwaatti! Ukhalhawaya miitho inyu anowoona ni maaru inyu anowiiwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ikekhia kinouhimeriani wiira, anamilhohi enchi ni attu enchi o nrima woombone yahothanana woona alha anoona inyu alha, ahoone, ni wiiwa alha nneewa inyu alha, ahiiwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhamulha malhikaanihero a ntu o waalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Paahi mwiiweke, ni wiittucha malhikaaniho o ntu o waalha imbeyu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Attu ariyoothe aneewa nlhove no Imwene ya Nlhuku nansho ahichuwelhaka, ari thoko imbeyu chaamorenlhe vaphironi. Nakare nowa ni uthesha imbeyu chaalhiye munrimani mwaya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamonre vanagagani chinokhalha thoko attu vaneewa aya nttenga anopochera uno ateelhiyaka munrimani. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho nttenga khunolhokelha munrimani mwaya ukhalhawaya khachinkhalha ni mithithaari nhina mwaya. Uhuvihiya vanowa aya wo nlhatu no nttenga nno, anookhwa nrima wo uhipicha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamonre vamiiwani chineemelhelha attu aneewa nttenga, nansho nipampa naacharaka ni nikakata no velhaponi nivaravaraka nttenga uyo, ni ayo khaneemma maphepu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ni imbeyu chaalhiye vachaayirani chinene chineemelhelha attu aneewa nttenga ni uchuwelha chihimiye, khwimmaka rata maphepu, mmoka imia, nkina makhumi sita ni nkina makhumi mararu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no mahichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimiachera nlhikaaniho nikina eeraka, “Umwene wo wiirimu uri thoko ntu aanlhe imbeyu choombone mmatani mwawe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uhiyu attu anarumpe, mmalhaponi nkaawa, nkaaphateelha mahichi mmeelheni nkaarwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Minyepu vonnuwa aya ni meelhe aphiyaka vanothaphuruwa aya, mahichi ni ayo phi nothaphuruwa aya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Akarumiya o mwanene imata nkaawa ni umwiirelha mwanene imata, ‘Munna, kwaani khamwaanlhe imbeyu choombone umatani ulhe, vano mahichi alhe ankhuma vayi?’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Anene imata phi naakhulha aya, ‘Amalhaponi phi phateelhe yayo mahichi ayo.’ Ni anamitheko ayo khunkohaka mwanene imata ‘Nnoona chani vano etu, nirweeke ngati naphelhacheke mahichi ayo?’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mwanene imata khwaakulhaka tho. ‘Mena, nhirwee, ukhalhawaya mwarwaaka, nnokoophelha mahichi ni meelhe vamoka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nhiyeke chonkhaye chunnuweke rata mpaka nlhaalha vanohalha aya waaya. Vavawo kinowa koohimierani wiira nrweeke mwaphelhacheke thoko mahichi ayo, mwattukacheke matita matita, ni upaha vamooroni. Mwamalhaka mwakhwacheke meelhe ayo ni uthokoreria nnikhupini.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhikaanera imbeyu yo haradali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkaalhamulhelha nlhikaaniho nikina, “Imwene yo Wiirimu iri thoko choo. Ntu ahaalha imbeyu yo iharadali umatani wawe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Imbeyu inene iyo iri yooyeva upwaha imbeyu chikina chonkhaye, nansho vanonnuwa aya unokhalha mwiri mulhupalhe chinene upwaha miri chikina. Khukhalhaka mwiri unothekiya iphuuru cha ashinuni o wiirimu mmarittani mwaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ihengedure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria nlhikaaniho nikhwawe tho, “Imwene yo wiirimu iri thoko opani anowiaa ihengedure vakani ni uthuwaniha ni iphepa madebe melhi ni ntikha, nkayaarurummwa yonkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Malhikaaniho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mako 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ahaahimiachera attu yayo onkhaye ayo wo ulhikaanihacha, khoolhumanche nlhove wo uhikhalha ni malhikaaniho. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Eera chiicho wo utimiriha chaahimiye ni anamilhohi wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kinowulhumacha wo ulhikaaniha vanohalha aka wolhumana,</para>
  <para style="q">Kinoowa kaapatakulha malhove ahinapacha aya wiiwa toka wuupiya ilhapo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhamulha nlhikaaniho no mahichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu vaathamme awe ni ukelha mpaani, owiittucha awe nkayaawa ni umwiirelha, “Nkanihimerieni maana o nlhikaaniho no mahichi amenlhe umatani, phi ishiyani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu aanlhe imbeyu choombone phi Mwaana a Ntu, <verse number="38" style="v"/>imata phi ilhapo ilha, imbeyu choombone phi attu o Imwene, mahichi phi attu a Nakare, <verse number="39" style="v"/>ni amalhaponi anlhe mahichi phi Nakare. Nlhaalha phi umalha wo ilhapo, ni attu o khungura phi minepa o wiirimu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Chenre aya wo uphelhiya mahichi ni upahiya vamooroni, phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku no umalha ilhapo, <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu nowa waaruma minepa o wiirimu awe avire aakhungura attu ukhuma Umweneni wawe, alhe onkhaye aattekihilhe attu ni ayo o uwonya, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ni waariha umooroni, unohalha aya wunlha ni ushilha miino. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Vavawo attu o rera nrima anowa waaria thoko nchuwa wi Umweneni wa Athithi. Mwiiweke, nri ni maaru!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no nhakhu waavithiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Umwene wo wiirimu uri thoko, ntu novitulha nhakhu waavithiye umatani. Nkaawuhelha, nkaahokolhia uwani nateelhiye urwaa uuthumihani kila ittu irinawe, ni uhokolhia urwaa uwoopolhani imata iyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ilulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Tho, Umwene wo wiirimu uri thoko ntu naavia ilulu yo nhakhu, <verse number="46" style="v"/>vanovitulha awe imoka yorera chinene, khurwaaka uuthumihani kila ittu irinawe, ni woopolha ilulu iyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no nttavi no ihopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Tho, Umwene wo wiirimu uri thoko attu o wiiva ihopa anriaa nttavi munttiyani ni uvara ihopa yo kila nikosho. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nttavi vanchara aya, khupurulhaka ni ukhalha nipuro vachereshere nttiya, athanlhe ihopa. Choombone chiyo kuhelhiyaka mmakayani, nansho cho uhilhokalhoka chiyo khurihiyaka. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Inohalha ukhalha thoko chommo nihuku noomalhelha ilhapo, minepa o wiirimu anowa aavira aakhunguraka attu o uhilhoka mwa attu o nrima woombone <verse number="50" style="v"/>ni waariha umooroni, unohalha aya wunlha ni ushilha miino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o Naanno ni meettuchiho o Khalhayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Chani nhochuwelha ulha mwaha ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo nihochuwelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkeera, “Kila ntu owiittuchiha Malhehero neettucha ukhuma Imwene yo wiirimu nokhalha thoko ntu ri ni inupa nokumiha chittu cho naanano ni chittu cho khalhayi ukhuma munhakhuni mwawe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhotiya Unazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu amalhiheke uhimia yayo malhikaaniho ayo, nkaathama vavawo <verse number="54" style="v"/>nkaahokolhia uwannyawe. Nkeettuchiha mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku, ni attu amwiiwa nkaashangacha. Nkayaakohanacha eeraka. “Ana yolha pantte vayi chechilha irusho chilha? Ni wooria upanga cho ushangiha chi? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ana yolha kahiwe phi ulhe mwaana a ntu nokoorosha milhako ni ihiche ulhe? Amariamu kahiwe phi anumwanawe, ni achihimawe kahiwe Nayakhobo ni Nayusufu ni Nasimoni ni Nayuda? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ashirokorawe onkhaye kahiwe phi alha anokhalha ni hii alha vaa?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkayankhotacha.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeera, “Namilhohi nolhohiya wa amalhaponi, nansho uwannyawe wa ashilhoko awe nookhotiya.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Wo nlhatu no ulhipa waya nrima, khaapannge yo ushangiha iriyoothe wowo.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nookhwa a Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Naherode amwene, o Ugalilaya yaheewa mwaha wa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkayeerelha anamitheko aya eeraka, “Ulha ntu ulha phi Nayohana Obatiiza, hohihimmwa ukhuma nnookhwani, phi nlhatu no woona ikuru yo ushangiha inopanga ntheko mwiiruttuni mwawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Naherode phi alhehenre wiira Nayohana avariye ni uttukiya mittondoro ni urweehiya ujeerani, wo nlhatu ni Naherodiya, mahanu a Nafilipo, ahima aya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nlhatu waari Nayohana waamuka Naherode wiira, “Khavanorera inyu waathelha Naherodiya ahanu a ahima inyu!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Naherode nkayaathanana weeva Nayohana, nansho yaari oovaka attu ukhalhawaya yaari achuwelhaka wiira Nayohana aari anamilhohi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nihuku no wuupuwelhiya uyaria waya Naherode, mwalhi mwaana a Naherodiya aheena machoma rata vaalhetoni. Naherode nkayaateelhiya, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ata nkayanlhupelha eeraka, “Kinouvaha ittu iriyoothe inottuna awo uvekelha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ni mwalhi uyo wo uchopelhiya ni anumwanawe, nkaavekelha eeraka, “Kinothanana naanano vava muru u Nayohana Obatiiza uneeshiye mphacheni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Amwene Naherode nkayaakelhiya ihuzuni, nansho wo naapo naalhupenlhe aya vaattuni, nkayaalhehera wiira avahiye. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Paahi nkayanruma ntu arwee ujerani aahithe Nayohana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Muru nkawaawiihiya mphacheni, nkaavahiya mwalhi ulhe, ni uyo nkaarwehelha anumwanawe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Owiittucha a Nayohana nkayaawa, nkayaakusha iruttu iyo, urwaa uwavithani, nkayaarwaa unhimeriani Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhiha attu maelufu nthanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu eeweke mwaha u Nayohana, nkaathama vavawo vakittu vawo nkayaawelhacha nkalhavani, nkaarwa vakittu vo wiivitha yeekha awe. Attu yeeweke, nkayaathama mmawannyaya nkayanttwara wo mieto. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu akhuruweke nkalhavani, nkoona nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu, nrima awe nkawaakelhiya ikiriri, nkaalhamiha areta mareta aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vaari aya uchechilho, owiittucha awe nkayanrweelha ni umwiirelha, “Uheelha vano, ni va vakittu va vauthakoni. Paahi etu mwaalheheke attu wiira athamache ahokolhieke mmawani athumeke yolhia.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khavanooria waahiya chiicho, mwaavaheke yolhia mwaattiva!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ayo nkayamwaakhulha, “Khanirina yolhia, nirina mikatte mithanu ni ihopa pilhi.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Nkiwiihereke vaa.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkaalhehera attu akhalhe vathi mmanyashini, nkaakusha mikatte mithanu chilhe ni ihopa pilhi chilhe, nkaaweha wiirimu, nkalhapelhelha ibarakha, nkaamianihacha nkaavaha owiittucha awe yaakawelhe attu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaalhia ni uwona. Yamalheke owiittucha nkayaakusha mikatte chaahanlhe, nkayaachariha makaya khumi ni melhi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Attu yaalhilhie yaari manyaalhopwana maelufu nthanu, wo uhaalhakelha manyaathiyana ni ashaana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweeta vachulhu maashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoha 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhanyereriha owiittucha awe awelhe nkalhavani aaholhelhe ukhopelhelhe nttiya, mwanene vaahiya awe ni waalheha attu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Amalheke waalheha attu, ahothama nkaawelha umwaakoni ulhapelhani. Yesu aari wowo yeekha awe mpaka uchechilho, <verse number="24" style="v"/>yeyo ikatema iyo ikalhava ilhe yaari inaphiilhe variyari nttiya, nansho yaari ithemwihiyaka ni iphioo yaawuka yaakakhaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mapikoosha, Yesu nkaawa wa owiittucha awe eetaka vachulhu maashi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe vaamwonne aya eetaka vachulhu maashi nkayoova chinene, nkayeera, “Nshoka!” Nkayaakhuwelha yoovaka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha eeraka, “Nvareke nrima! Phi mii. Nhoove” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayaamwakhulha eeraka, “Thithi, akhalhaka phi inyuva we ikekhiaye, mwiireke etu ni mii keete vachulhu maashi kiwe varii inyu.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mmweeke.” Paahi Napeturo nkayaakhuruwa nkalhavani, nkayeeta vachulhu maashi, arwaaka vaari awe Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho yooneke iphioo iwukaka, nkayoova, nkayaachokholha utitimira akhuwelhaka, “Thithi, nkoopolhe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkaavara moono nkeerelha, “Nrima wani mwankani nrina inyu! Woonaka nnowoova?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yamalheke o yelhi nkayaawelha nkalhavani, ni iphioo nkayaatondova. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Owiittucha onkhaye yaari nkalhavani nkayanthimicha, eeraka, we ikekhiaye inyuva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu Ugenesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mako 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkayaalhapuwa nttiya nkayaaphiya Ugenesareti, <verse number="35" style="v"/>attu nkayanchuwelha Yesu. Paahi nkayanrweehelha areta onkhaye yaari mmawani. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nkayanlhepelha aahiyere avare inakhalhaka nlhuto no ikuwo chawe, ni attu onkhaye yaavanre aholhamacha.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho a manyaapwiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mako 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yahonttwara Yesu ukhuma Uyerusalemu uwa unkohani, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nlhatu waani owiittucha inyu khantuna meettuchiho nipochenre ihu wa ashulhupalhe? Khanonyawa mathatha rata thoko chinolheheriya aya ahinaya ulhia yolhia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Wo nlhatu waani mwaatti khannottwara malheheriyo a Nlhuku, nansho nttwaraka meettuchiho inyu mwaashinene? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nlhuku heera wiira, ‘Mwaathimicheke athumwaninyu ni anumwaninyu, ni ntu riyoothe naaruwana athumwanawe ama anumwanawe, yoyo nambaya eeviye.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nansho mwaattiva nnettuchiha wiira ntu akhalhanaka ittu yo waavaha athumwanawe ama anumwanawe, nansho eeraka, ‘Ilha ittu ilha kihommaha isadaka Nlhuku,’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>paahi, ahaalhohe tho athumwanawe! Chiichammo etu phi hinolhoha inyu malheheriyo a Nlhuku, nlhatu no uttwara meettuchiho inyu mwaanene. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwaattiva va, anafiki! Ashinna Isaya aholhohera rata o waachakani mwaatti!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>‘Nlhuku neera, Alha attu alha anokithimicha wo malhoveru, nansho munrimani mwaya arii utayi ni mii.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ukithimicha waya khunolhoka,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukhalhawaya aneettuchiha malhove a attu, nansho anari malheheriyo aka!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Chittu chinonnyalhiha ntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mako 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkeehana nlhoko wa attu, nkeerelha, “Mwiiweke ni uchuwelha! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ittu inonhelha ntu nsheru kihiwe inokelha vamalhakuni, nansho chilhe chinokhuma mmwano phi chechiyo chinonnanariha ntu,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yamalheke owiittucha nkayaawa, nkayeera, “Chani, nhochuwelha wiira Amafarisayo ahorushiya veewilhe aya malhove inyu?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kila ntepo uhaalhiye ni Athithi o wiirimu unoophelhiya.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Nhoove yayo manyaattu ayo! Yayo phi aholhelhi o hoona, aaholhelhaka o hoona akhunanaya, onkhaye elhi ayo anootumbuchira munlhikitini.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayeera, “Nkanilhamulhelheni nenno nlhikaaniho nno.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ata mwaattiva khannochuwelha mpaka nna? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira ittu inokelha mmwano inokelha munthunkwani, kaanyuma khukumihiyaka urindini? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nansho chittu chinokhumelha uwano chinokhuma munrimani, ni chiyo phi nonnanariha ntu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya munrimani mwa ntu phi nokhuma malhove o uhilhoka, o wiiva, o ulhuva, o ulhavalhava, o wiiya, o woothacha ni o uruwana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yayo phi no nnanariha ntu. Nansho ulhia yolhia wo uhinyawa mathatha thoko chineera inyu khunonnanariha ntu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nthiyana o nrima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mako 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathama vavawo vakitu vawo nkaarwa uukhalhani ilhapo yaatamana ni iwani cho Utiro ni Usidoni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Opani amoka Akananayo aakhalha yeyo ilhapo iyo ahonrweelha Yesu nkayaakhuwelha eeraka, “Mwaana a Adaudi, ukoonelhe ikiriri Thithi! Mwaamwanaka, mwalhi noohuvihiya ni mashoka o unanara.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe nlhove. Paahi owiittucha awe yahonrwelha, nkayaamwirelha, “Mwaahiyeke arwee! Khannoona wiira anonittwarattwara ni uninyakulha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kirumiye wa attu o inupa yo Israeli vekha aya, apotenre thoko ikhondoro chihiri ni nshunga.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Opani ayo nkayaawa, nkayaakhoroma, nkayeera, “Thithi nkoonelhe ikiriri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khavanorera waathurulha ashaana yolhia aya ni waawonyera ashipwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Opani ayo nkaayakhulha, “Eiyo Thithi, nansho ata ashipwa ayo anoorokottacha cholhia chinomoramora vamezani va apwiiya aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vavawo Yesu nkaakhulha, “Maanyi nrima inyu mulhupalhe! Paahi etu, mpangelhiyeke thoko chinothanana inyu.” Yeyo isaa, mwalhi aya uyo nkaalhama.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu enchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathama vavawo nkaarwa uchereshere ibahari yo Ugalilaya. Nkaawelha mmwaakoni, nkaakhalha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Attu enchi nkayammweelha, yaawihaka attu o heeta ni o uhiweha ni o remara ni o uhulhumacha ni attu akina enchi yaari areta, nkayeeshiya vamietoni va Yesu, nkaalhamihacha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nlhoko wa attu nkawoomiya uwanoni chinene yooneke attu ohulhumacha yuulhumachaka, oremara alhamaka, oheeta yeetaka ni attu o hoona yoonaka, attu nkayanthimicha Nlhuku o Uisraeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhiha attu enchi akina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mako 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkeehana owiittucha awe, nkeera, “Kinowoonelha ikiriri alha attu alha wo nlhatu no ukhalha ni mii wo mahuku mararu wo uhilhia. Ni mii khakinooria waahiya wo uhilhia, anookomwaacha mphironi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayankoha, “Ninohalha upatta vayi yolhia yo uwanelha attu enchi thoko alha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Nrina mikatte nchani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwakhulha, “Chiri mikatte saba ni achihopa vakani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Paahi, Yesu nkaalhehera wiira attu akhalhihiye vathi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nkaawiaa mikatte chilhe ni achihopa alhe, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, nkaamianihacha, nkaavaha owiittucha, ni ayo nkayaakawelha attu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaalhia, nkayaawonacha. Yamalheke owiittucha nkayaakusha mahalha aahanlhe, nkayaachariha makaya saba. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Attu yaalhilhie yaari manyaalhopwana maelufu ncheshe, wo uhaalhakelha manyopani ni ashaana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaalheha attu, nkaathama nkaawelha nkalhavani, nkaarwa ilhapo yo Umagadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uvekelhiya cho ushangiha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mako 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina ni Amasadukayo nkayanrwelha Yesu, athananaka unlhikacha. Nkayanlhepelha oonihe cho ushangiha cho wiirimu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vaneelha aya nchuwa mwaattiva nneera, ‘Uheelha rata, ukhalhawaya irimu ihokhwilha.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vanosha nchuwa nneera, ‘Ipulha inoorupa lhelho, nlhatu no ukhwiilha irimu ni ipiphi.’ Nnohukumulha mahuku wo uweha irimu, nansho nkelhiyaka nipampa wo uhichuwelha ithikineha cha alha mahuku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mwinre chani mwaatti o uhilhoka attu a alha mahuku o ulhuva va! Nnovekelha woona ithikineha? Ithikineha nnohalha inyu uvahiya phi i Nayona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Paahi etu nkayaathamacha ni uhokolhia umawannyaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Ihengedure ya Amafarisayo ni Amasadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mako 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Owiittucha vaalhapuwilhe aya nthelha wo nayelhi wo nttiya, yaari analhiyanlhe ukusha mikatte. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhiitialhe, mwiichinanelheke ni ihengedure ya Amafarisayo ni ya Amasadukayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nansho nkayaahalha akohanachaka ashineneru, “Ana, neera chiicho wo nlhatu no uhikusha mikatte?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha ittu yaanyihera aya, nkeera, “Inyu attu nrii ni nrima mwankani! Chani woonaka nnarerihelha mwaha wo ulhiyalha ukusha mikatte? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chani khannachuwelha? Khannoopuwelha vaamianihilhe aka mikatte nthanu ni waalhiha attu maelufu nthanu? Makaya nchani yaacharihilhe inyu mahalhahalha o mikatte yaahalhenlhe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chani khannopuwelha mwaha wo mikatte saba chaakawelhiye aya attu maelufu ncheshe chilhe, chani mwaarokontte makaya nchani o mahalhahalha? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chani khannopuwelha wiira akahimmie ittu inaacha mikatte? Mwiichinanelheke meettuchiho o uhilhoka a Amafarisayo ni Amasadukayo!” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vavawo owiittucha nkayaachuwelha wiira eerelha wiira eechinanelhe kuhii ni ihengedure yo ururumulha mikatte, nansho ni meettuchiho o uhilhoka a Amafarisayo ni Amasadukayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Urumelhelha u Napeturo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarwa ilhapo cho Ukaisariya Filipi, waakohilhe awe owiittucha awe, “Attu aneera Mwaana a Ntu phi mpani?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkayaamwaakulha, “Akina aneera Nayohana Obatiiza, akina aneera Naeliya, akina Nayeremiya ama namilhohi nkina.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Ni mwaattiva chani, nneera mii phi mpani?” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakulha, “Inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi, Mwaana a Nlhuku rii nkumi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Nhoreeriya inyuva Nasimoni ashaana a Bariyona. Ukhalhawaya iruttu ni iphome khachipatakunlhe uwaninyu nna nlhove nna, yaahikalhe Athumwanaka arii wiirimu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ni mii kinouhimeriani, inyuva Napeturo, inyuva phi mwalha, ni vachulhu ulha mwalha ulha kinootheka nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, mena machiri o unaminepa khanowa ooriaka uphomolha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kinowuvahani mittukulho cho Umwene wo wiirimu, chinohalha inyu uttuka velhaponi va chinoottukiya chiicho wiirimu, chinohalha inyu uttukulha velhaponi va, chinoottukulhiya chiicho wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha, nkaachiichiha owiittucha wiira ahinhimiachere ntu riyoothe wiira aari phi Kuristo Moopolhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowulhumachera uhuvihiya ni ukhwa wawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mako 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Uchokholhelha vavawo, Yesu nkaachokholha uhimiacha mwaari wo owiittucha awe wiira, “Ihokiphwanelha wiira kirwee Uyerusalemu kahuvihachiye chinene ni ashulhupalhe ni Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni attu owiittuchiha Malhehero. Kinowiiviya, nansho nihuku no neraru kinowa kaahihimmwa.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vavawo Napeturo nkayankusha Yesu vachereshere, nkayaamwamuka, “Nlhuku khanooria wiira chiicho Thithi! Khavanooria!” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaarukunuwa, nkeerelha Napeturo, “Uthame va uwe Nakare! Inyuva phi itiyelhelho uwannyaka, ukhalhawaya irusho chinyu khachinokhuma wa Nlhuku, chinokhuma wa ntuni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yamalheke, Yesu nkaahimeria owiittucha awe, “Ntu riyoothe nothanana ukittwara mii, eeruneke mwanene, akusheke nsalaaba awe, akittwareke. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya, ntu nothanana woopolha ukumi awe mwanene, nowa upoteriha, nansho noriha ukumi awe wo nlhatu waka nowa upatta. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chani, ntu nolhoha upuha ittu yaani apattaka mpuha wonkhaye wo velhaponi va ni uno apoteriha ukumi awe? Khiiwo mena! Khiiwo nolhoha awe ukumiha wiira apatte ukumi awe tho. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya, Mwaana a Ntu nolhoha uwa ni nthimicho wa Athumwanawe vamoka ni minepa cho wiirimu chawe, vavawo phi nohalha awe unlhiva kila ntu inomphwanelha wo ulhikaana ni mitheko chawe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wo ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani wiira, ahawo akina va khanonlhawiha nookhwa ahinaya umwoona Mwaana a Ntu awaaka ni Umwene awe.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorukunuwa ikhove</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mako 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yavireke mahuku sita, Yesu nkaakusha Napeturo ni Nayakhobo ni Nayohana nhima aya, nkaarwana vekha ayaru vachulhu mwaako wo urekama. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vammweha aya, Yesu nkaarukunuwa ikhove, ikhove awe nkayaapharelha thoko nchuwa ni ikuwo chawe nkachaateelha ttuuu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Owiittucha araru ayo nkayoona ashinna Musa ni Naeliya yaarerihaka ni Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vavawo Napeturo nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Thithi, ihorera hii ukhalha vaa! Mwathananaka kinookorosha mahema mararu, nimoka nawinyu, nimoka ni ashinna Musa nimoka ni Naeliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vaari awe olhumachaka chiicho, nihute nooteelha nkanaakhuneelha, ni nlhove nkaneewaniaa nnihuteni niiraka, “Ulha phi Mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka, nookitelhiha nrima, mmwiiwelhelheke yoyo!” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Owiittucha yeeweke chiicho nkayaawulhuwa makukhu, nkayoova chinene. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarwelha, nkaavaracha. Nkeera, “Mwemelheke, nhoove!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vaawenhe aya uchulhu khayamwoonne ntu nkina, ahikhalhe Yesu vekha awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi, vaakhuruwa aya umwaakoni, Yesu nkaamuka nkeerelha wiira, “Nhinhimiachere ntu ritoothe ulha mwaha upatakulhelhiye inyu ulha mpaka nihuku no uhihimmwa Mwaana a Ntu.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yamalheke owiittucha nkayankoha Yesu, “Chani woonaka owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa aneera wiira Naeliya phi nohalha uholhelha uwa?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha eeraka, “Wo ikekhiaye, Naeliya phi nohalha uholhelha uwa, uweeshani tayari chittu chonkhaye. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira, Naeliya ahomalha uwa nansho attu khayaachuwenlhe, nkayaapangelha chaathananne aya. Mwaana a Ntu ni uyo noowa aahuvihiya chiichammo mmathathani mwaya.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi etu owiittucha nkayaachuwelha wiira aari aahimeriaka mwaha unaacha Nayohana Obatiiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha mmirawo o nshoka no unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vaahokolhelhe aya wa attu, ntu mmoka nkaawa wa Yesu, nkankhoromelha, <verse number="15" style="v"/>nkeera, “Thithi, mmwonelhe ikiriri mwaamwanaka! Nreta ichilhichilhi, noohuva chinene. Ikatema chinchi noowulhuwelha vamooroni ama mmaashini. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kahommwiiha wa owiittucha inyu, nansho khayonrie unlhamiha.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva attu o iyari ihiri ni nrima, ipotenre! Kinohalha ukhalha ni inyu mpaka iyaakhani? Kuuvilhelhekeni mpaka iyaakhani? Mummwiiheke mmirawo inyu uyo vaa.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaachachera nshoka nno, nkanankhuma mwaana uyo, yeyo isaa nkaalhama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayaawacha wa Yesu nkayankoha wo ntemera wiira, “Ana chani woonaka hii khanoonrie woomolha nshoka nne?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha eeraka, “Wo ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani wiira, mwakhalhaka ni nrima inakhalhaka vakani thoko imbeyu yo iharadali, nnowooria wiirelha ulha mwaako ulha, ‘Nthame vaa nrwee uwo!’ Ni uyo unoorwaa. Nnowooria upanga ittu iriyoothe!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mwoochenlhe wo nlhatu no ulhipa mirima chinyu. Nansho nshoka thoko nenno ninothamihiya wo iphiro yo unlhepelha Nlhuku uttuka ulhia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhimiacha tho nookhwa awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vaari awe akhalhaka ni owiittucha awe onkhaye Ugalilaya, Yesu aheerelhacha, “Mwaana a Ntu haatameria vo uhelhiya mmathathani mwa attu <verse number="23" style="v"/>anohalha umwiiva, nansho nihuku no neraru nowa aahihimushiya muukumini.”</para>
  <para style="p">Owiittucha awe nkayaakelhiya ihuzuni chinene.</para>
  <para style="s">Malhivo o Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe vaaphilhe aya Ukapenaumu, attu o ulhiviha ikhodi yo Inupa ya Nlhuku nkayaawa u Napeturo ni waakoha, “Owiittuchiha inyu anoolhiva ikhodi yo inupa ya Nlhuku?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, anoolhiva.” Napeturo vaakenlhe aya mpaani, Yesu nkaaholhelha wulhumacha eeraka, “Nasimoni, nnoopuwelha chani? Apani amphwanelhiya ulhiva ikhodi wa mamwene o velhaponi va? Anenchi ama alheto?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayaakhulha eeraka, “Alheto phi nophwanelhiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Aye, anenchi khanlhivihiya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nansho wo wiira nihaahuvihe munrimani, nrweeke etu unttiyani mwariheke indoana mmenjeke, mwakusheke ihopa inohalha inyu uvara iyo, mwapatakulheke iyano aya nnokoophwanya nchurukhu unthosha ulhiva ikhodi yawaka ni yawinyu. Mwaavaheke wiira ninoolhiva ikhodi yo inupa ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mpani ri Mulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo owiittucha nkayaawa wa Yesu, nkayankoha, “Phi mpani ri mulhupalhe chinene mu Imwene yo wiirimu?” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwiihana mwanhima, nkaamwemesha variyari aya, <verse number="3" style="v"/>nkeera, “Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, mwaahirukunuweke ni ukhalha thoko achihima, khannowa mwaakelha wi Imwene yo wiirimu mena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mulhupalhe nhina Imwene yo wiirimu, ri phi ntu neetimarikha thoko ulha mwanhima ulha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe nompochera mwanhima thoko ulha wo nchina naka, nokipochera mii.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhikachiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mako 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe nohalha unttekiha mmoka aya alha ashinkani anokirumelhelha alha, irii mbaya yoyo ntu uyo attukelhelhiye nshilho nulhupalhe nshikoni ni utitimerihiya ubaharini wo wiisha chinene.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="18:6">Attu elhi anooshilha vanshilhoni</figure> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ihothapana ilhapo wo nlhatu no ulhikachiya unaawulhusha attu mu uwonyani! Ulhikachiya thoko chiicho unoowa waakhumelhelha, nansho ahothapana attu anohalha upanga chiicho!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Yakhalhaka moono inyu ama mweto inyu uhoottekihakani, ntupulheke ni urihelha uwo shoro! Iri mbaya inyuva ukelha mu ukumini wo uhikhalha ni moono ama mweto, kuliko urihiya umooroni uhintiphia mahuku o uhimalha nnari ni miono miilhi ni mieto chinyu miilhi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ni niitho ninyu noottekihakani, nkhulheke nrihelheke utayi. Iri nambaya wo inyuva ukelha mu ukumini nnari ni niitho nimoka, kuliko utikhelhiya vamooroni Ujehannamu nnari ni miitho melhi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ikhondoro ipotenre</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Mwiishungeke! Nhimpangelhe niphiondho mmoka aya ashinkani alha. Kinouhimeriani wiira minepa chaya cho wiirimu chiri muulhokelhani wo mahuku onkhaye wa Athumwanaka o wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu wiilhe woopolha attu apotenre. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nnoona chani, ntu akhalhaka ni ikhondoro imia imoka, yapoteraka imoka, nopangani? Noohiya chilhe makhumi tisa ni tisa umwaakoni, nkaarwa uuthothani ikhondoro imoka ipotenre. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vanoona awe, we ikekhiaye vavawo phi nottapelhelha awe wo nlhatu no ikhondoro imoka iyo, ipwahaka chikhwawe makhumi tisa ni tisa chaahanlhe chiyo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Phi chiichammo, Athumwanihu o wiirimu vahinotuna aya inakhalhaka mmoka aya alha ashinkani alha apotere.”</para>
  <para style="s">Waamukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Yakhalhaka munninyu hoottekelhani, nrweeke mwamwaamukeke. Nansho mwamwaamukeke nnari elhi vekha inyu. Owiiwaakani, nhompatta nhima inyu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nansho aahiwelhelheke, munkusheke ntu mmoka ama attu elhi mwaarwaneke, akhalhe phi attu o uhimiechesha nenno nlhove nno, thoko chinohimiya ni Malhove Matakatifu, attu elhi ama araru. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Aahiwelhelheke yayo attu ayo, nhimiacheke wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. Aahiwelhelheke nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, ooniyeke etu thoko attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku ama attu anolhiviha ikhodi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uchiichiha ni uhiyerera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Vavawo, kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye mwaatti wiira, chinohalha inyu uttuka velhaponi va, chinoottukiya chiicho wiirimu, ni chittu chinohalha inyu uttukulha velhaponi va, chinoottukulhiya chiicho wiirimu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tho kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, attu o irusho cho uchuwelha mu nlhokoni mwinyu yeewananaka velhaponi va nlhove niriyoothe no ulhepelha, Athumwanaka o wiirimu anoupangelhani nenno nlhove nno. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya variwoothe wanthukumana aya attu elhi ama araru wo nchina naka, mii kirii vavawo vamoka ni ayo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no karumiya o uhilheva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayanttwara Yesu, nkankoha, “Eti Thithi, nhimaaka akittekelhaka, kinlhevelheke vachani? Mikwaha saba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Akineera vathanu ni velhi, nansho makhumi saba mikwaha saba. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Umwene wo wiirimu unolhikaana ni mwene mmoka aalhakenlhe uwehaweha maalhakelho a anamitheko aari nhina mamulaka awe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vaachokhonlhe awe, nkaawiheriya ntu mmoka aari ni nlhatu wo nchurukhu ishilingi maelufu khumi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yoyo ntu uyo khaarina ittu iriyoothe yo ulhiva nlhatu awe, paahi eti anene ntheko ayo nkayaalhehera wiira athumihiye ipotta, ahanu awe, achishaana awe ni chittu chonkhaye chirinawe, alhive nlhatu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Paahi yoyo karumiya uyo nkaakhoroma wa mwanene nhakhu uyo, nkeera, ‘Nkilhite, ni mii kinoulhivani nlhatu winyu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwanene ntheko uyo nkayaamwonelha ikiriri namitheko uyo, nkanhiyerera nlhatu wonkhaye, nkanhiya arweeke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nansho namitheko uyo mwanene nkaathama, nkamphwanya mmoka a anamitheko akhunanawe aari ni nlhatu wo nchurukhu ishilingi imia imoka. Nkammara, nkaamwama ishiko eeraka, ‘Nkilhive nlhatu aka!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Karumiya nkhunanawe nkaakhoroma, nkammenda eeraka, ‘Nkilhite ni mii kinowulhivani.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho uyo khaattunne, nkanttuka ujeerani mpaka vaalhinve awe nlhatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Paahi, anamitheko ashikhunanawe yooneke yayo yahochukulha chinene, nkayaarwaa uwaahimeriani amwene mwaha wonkhaye ukhumelhenlhe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vavawo anene ntheko nkayaamwiihana yoyo karumiya uyo, nkaamwirelha, ‘Uwe karumiya o uhilhoka chinene! Wahokilhepelha, ni mii nkakoohiyerera nlhatu wonkhaye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nhothananiya umonelha ikiriri karumiya nkhunaninyu thoko mii chowonenlhe akani ikiriri.’” <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Amwene nkayaarushiya chinene, nkantikhelha ujerani atwarushiye mpaka vanohalha awe ulhiva nlhatu wonkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Ni Athumwanaka arii wiirimu, anoupangelhani chiichammo yakhalhaka kila mmoka inyu khanohiyerera uwonya wa nhima awe wo nrima awe wonkhaye.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaamuka mwaha wo umwalhaana nthelhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mako 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo, ahothama Ugalilaya, nkaarwa Uyudea, ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Attu enchi nkayanttwara, ni uyo nkaalhamiha wowo mareta aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina nkayanttwara, nkayankoha wo unlhikacha, “Eti, inorera nlhopwana waahiya ahanu awe wo nlhatu uriyoothe?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, khannashoma Malhove Matakatifu alhepiye wiira Nlhuku voopilhe awe ilhapo ahomuupa nlhopwana ni nthiyana? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nlhuku nkeera, ‘Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu nlhopwana nowaahiya athumwanawe ni anumwanawe, ni ulhutaana ni ahanu awe ni ukhalha iruttu imoka?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, yayo kahena attu elhi tho, nansho iruttu imoka. Paahi, chilhutanihiye ni Nlhuku, ntu himwalhaanihe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayankoha yeeraka, “Nlhatu waani etu, ashinna Musa unilhehera wiira nthiyana avahiyeke italaka ni uhiiya?” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ashinna Musa ovahilheni nlhove no waahiya manyaahanu inyu wo nlhatu no ulhipa mirima winyu. Nansho khachaakhanlhe chiicho voopiye aya ilhapo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi kinouhimeriani wiira, nlhopwana riyoothe nohalha waamwalhaana ahanu awe yaahikalhe wo nlhatu wo ulhavalhava, ni uyo nolhavalhava aathelhaka athiyana akina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayaamwirelha, “Yakhalhaka mwaha wa nlhopwana ni nthiyana phiri aya chiicho, nambaya etu ukhalha wo uhithelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Kaahiwe attu onkhaye anooria upochera meettuchiho thoko alha, yaahikalhe attu areeriye ni Nlhuku. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya chihawo milhatu chikina chinaapanga alhopwana ahithelhe, ukhalhawaya akina aayarelhe chiicho toka munthunkwani mwa anumwanaya, akina wo nlhatu nopangiya chiicho ni attu, ni attu akina athananne anene uhithelha wo nlhatu no Umwene wo wiirimu. Nolhoha wooria urumelhelha nna nlhove nna, akhalheke chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaavaha ibarakha ashaana ashinkani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yamalheke attu nkayammwiihera Yesu ashaana ashinkani awe eeshera miono ni waalhapelhelha, nansho owiittucha nkayaachiichihacha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mwaahiyeke ashaana awe uwannyaka, mena nhaachiichihe, ukhalhawaya Imwene yo wiirimu iri ya attu arii thoko alha ashaana alha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paahi nkeesheracha miono, amalheke nkaathama vavawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mmirawo o Nhakhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka nkaawa wa Yesu, nkankoha, “Owiittuchiha, kipangeke ittu yaani yoombone ni mii kipatte ukumi wo uhimalha?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Woonaka nnokikoherera ittu yaani iri yorera? Orera ri mmoka tu. Mwathananaka ukelha mu ukumini, mmarechesheke malheheriyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yoyo ntu uyo nkaakoha, “Malheheriyo ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeera, “Nhiive, Nhilhavelhave, Nhiiye, nhoothache, <verse number="19" style="v"/>mwaathimicheke athumwaninyu ni anumwaninyu, ni waattuna amwaatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwaanene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mmirawo uyo nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Yayo onkhaye ayo kihovarechesha, kipangeke ittu yaani vano yo uthepa vavawo?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Mwathananaka ulhikaanelhiya nrweeke mwathumiheke nhakhu inyu wonkhaye, ni nchurukhu uyo mwaakawelheke attu ashikini, ni inyu nnowiicheshera nhakhu wiirimu, mwamalhihaka nkittwareke.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yoyo mmirawo uyo eeweke chiicho, nkaathama narushiye, ukhalhawaya aari ntu o nhakhu chinene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vavawo Yesu nkaahimeria owiittucha awe wiira, “Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, inowa urikarika chinene wo ntu o nhakhu ukelha wi Imwene yo wiirimu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani tho, iri vo urikarika chinene wo ntu o nhakhu ukhelha Imwene ya Nlhuku, upwaha ingamiya uperetta niitho no ntotto no utottelha ikuwo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Owiittucha yeeweke chiicho nkayoomiya uwanoni chinene, nkayankoha Yesu, “Phi mpani etu, nohalha ulhama?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaweha, nkeera, “Vaattuni khavanooria nansho kuhiwe wa Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya wa Nlhuku chonkhaye chinowooriacha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yamalheke Napeturo nkayeera, “Ni hii nihohiya chonkhaye nihoottwarani inyuva, ninohalha upattani etu?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria wiira, “Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, Mwaana a Ntu vanohalha awe ukhalhelha ihiche awe yo nthimicho wi Ilhapo yo Naanano, mwaattiva khumi ni elhi nkittwarilhe, nnoowa mwaakhalha mu imwene yo utawara, mwaahukumulhaka makosho khumi ni melhi o Uisraeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ni kila ntu hiilhe inupa ama aahilhe ashihima awe, ama ashirokorawe, ama athumwanawe, ama anumwanawe, ama ashaana awe, ama imata chawe, wo nlhatu no nchina naka, nowa upochera wo mamia ni upwaha, ni upatta ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho attu enchi anoholhelha vano anowa ukhalha o umalhelha, ni attu ari utulhi anowa ukhalha o uholhelha.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Anamitheko imata yo Zabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Umwene wo wiirimu unolhikaana ni ntu aari ni imata yo zabibu, aalhawenlhe wichishuru waavaha attu ntheko umatani wawe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkeewanana waalhiva thoko chaari aya chilhiviyaka, nchurukhu idinari imoka wo nihuku, nkaarweha u imata awe yo zabibu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vaari aya saa tatu wichishu, nkaarwa weehanani attu akina, nkoona attu ahirina ntheko aneemenlhe wo uhikhalha ni ntheko vanopangiya maronda, <verse number="4" style="v"/>nkeerelhacha, ‘Nrweeke ni inyu mwaattiva mwavareke ntheko imata yo zabibu, ni mii kinoulhivani iri ye ikekhiaye.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paahi nkayaarwaa. Saa sita uthana ni saa tisa nkeera chiicho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ata vaari aya saa khumi ni moja uchechilho, nkaarwa tho, nkaaphwanya attu akina anemelhanche vasokoni vawo. ‘Paahi nkaakoha, woonaka nhowemelhacha vaa uthana wonkhaye ulha wo uhikhalha ntheko?’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkayamwaakulha, ‘Khaawo ntu nivanhe ntheko.’ Ni uyo nkeerelhacha nrwaacheke ni inyu mwaattiva mwavare ntheko imata yo zabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Weelhekeru, mwanene imata yo zabibu nkanlhehera ntu noshunga nhakhu awe, ‘Mweehane attu ammara ntheko umatani ayo, mwaalhiveke malhivo aya, mpacheraka waalhiva attu awilhee katashi, ni wamalhihera o upacha alhe.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Attu yaachokhonlhe ntheko saa khumi ni moja nkayaalhiviya nchurukhu idinari imoka kila mmoka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu o upacha yaweeke, aari yaanyiheraka wiira anohalha ulhiviya waapwaha akina, nansho ata ni ayo yaavahiye kila mmoka idinari imoka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkayaakhelha nchurukhu aya, ni unchukulhachera mwanene ntheko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkayeera, ‘Attu avahiye ntheko katashi apannge ntheko wo isaa imoka tu, woonaka nnilhivilhe thoko yayo uno hii ninavilhenlhe ntheko woorika uthana wonkhaye niviaka nchuwa!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Vavawo mwanene ntheko nkaamwaakhulha mmoka aya, ‘Mpwana, akupangenlheni chittu cho uhilhoka. Chani, khanewananne ni mii malhivo o idinari imoka? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkusheke iri yawinyu, nrweeke. Kihothanana ummaha ulha o umalhihera thoko nlhiviye inyu inyuva. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Chani kinopanga ittu yo uhilhoka upanga chiicho wo nhakhu aka, thoko chinothanana aka? Ama nnoona ihache wo nlhatu no ukhalha ni nrima worera?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamalhiha wo wiira, “Chiicho, arii o umalhihera anowa ukhalha o upacha, ni o upacha anowa ukhalha o umalhihera.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhimiacha nookhwa awe vaneraru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe awelhaka urwaa Uyerusalemu, ahaattukana owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi ni waarerihana wo ntemera mphironi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkeerelha, “Mwiiwelhelheke, vano ninokelha Uyerusalemu, wowo Mwaana a Ntu nokoohelhiya mmathathani mwa attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa. Ni ayo anonhukumulha wiira eeviye <verse number="19" style="v"/>ni uvahiya attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, ampangelhe ncheche ni umwaata ikopo ni unkhomelhelha vansalaabani, nansho nihuku no neraru noohihimmwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhepelha wa anumwanaya Nayakhobo ni Nayohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mako 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vavawo anumwanaya ashaana a Nazebedayo yahonrwelha Yesu vamoka ni ashaana aya, nkaakhoroma vaari awe ni unlhepelha nlhove.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha “Nnothananani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakhulha, “Nlhupelheke wo uhimia wiira mu Imweneni winyu, alha ashaana aka elhi alha anowa ukhalha mmoka wiimonono winyu ni nkina uyo wiimushi winyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khanchuwenlhe ittu inolhepelha inyu, chani, nnowooria uwureria ikikombe yo ntwarusho inohalha aka uwureria mii?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwaakulha, “Eiyo ninowooria.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye nnowureria ikikombe aka, nansho akirina ikuru yo unthanlha nohalha ukhalha wiimonono ama wiimushi waka. Yayo mapuro ayo anohalha uvahiya attu eesheriye tayari ni Athumwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Owiittucha akina khumi alhe yeeweke yoyo mwaha uyo, nkayaarushiya nkayaathunalhelha yayo ashilhoko elhi ayo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkeehanacha, nkaahimeria wiira, “Nnoochuwelha wiira attu anaatawara attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, anaatawara attu wo machiri, ni nholhelhi aya aatawaraka attu aya. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nansho ihikalhe chiicho uwaninyu mwaattiva, namitheko nothanana ukhalha mulhupalhe munlhokoni mwinyu hothananiya ukhalha namitheko inyu, <verse number="27" style="v"/>ni ntu nothanana ukhalha o upacha nhina mwinyu hothananiya ukhalha ipotta inyu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wo yeyo iphiro iyo etu, Mwaana a Ntu khaawilhe awe aapangelhiya mitheko ni attu, nansho ukaviherani ni ukumiha ukumi awe ukhalha noopo wa attu akina.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu elhi ohoona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu vaathama awe iwani yo Uyeriko, nlhoko wa attu wahonttwara. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Paahi ahokhalha attu ohoona elhi yaakhanlhe vachereshere iphiro, yeeweke wiira Yesu noovira vavawo, nkayaakhuwelha, “Thithi, Mwaana a Adaudi, unoonelhe ikiriri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nlhoko wa attu nkawaachiichiha ni waamaalhiha. Nansho ayo nkayaathepa ukhuwelha, “Thithi Mwaana a Adaudi nnoonelhe ikiriri!” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkeemelha nkeehana ni waakoha “Nnothanana kupangelhekeni ittu yaani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nkayaaamwakulha, “Thithi ninolhepelha miitho ihu apatakuwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkoona ikiriri, nkaatonya miitho aya, ni vavawo nkayoona tho, nkayanttwara.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookelha wo uttapelhelhiya Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe vaatamenrie aya Uyerusalemu ahophiya Ubetifage waari mwaako wo Mizeituni. Wowo Yesu ahaaruma owiittucha awe elhi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>eerelhaka, “Nrweeke mpaka iwani iri miholho mwinyu ni wowo nnokoophwanya iphuta ihottukelhelhiya vamoka ni mwaamwanawe. Mwaathapulheke nkiwiihereke vaa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe okohakani ittu, mwamwiirelheke, ‘Athithi anonthanana,’ ni uyo nouhiyerani vavawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nlhove nna naapangelhe atimire malhove aatangiye ni anamilhohi yeera,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Mwiirelheke iwani yo Usayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">Mmweheke, mwene inyu noowa!</para>
  <para style="q">O wiitimarikha nawenlhe iphuta</para>
  <para style="q">Mwaaphuta, mwaana o phuta.”</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chiicho etu, owiittucha nkayaarwaa nkayaapanga thoko Yesu chaalheherilhe awe, <verse number="7" style="v"/>nkayammwiiha mwaaphuta uyo, nkayaathalhacha ikuwo chaya vachulhu wawe, ni Yesu nkaakhalha vachulhu vawo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu nkawaathalhacha ikuwo chaya mphironi, ni attu akina nkayontha maphumbulhu o miri nkayaathalhacha mphironi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Milhoko cha attu yaanholhenlhe ni alhe yanttwara yaari akhuwelhachaka yeeraka, “Hosana, Atotopelhiye Mwaana a Adaudi! Vahiye ibarakha, nowa wo nchina na Athithi! Athimichiye Nlhuku, wiirimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu vaaphiya awe Uyerusalemu, iwani yonkhaye nkayaakhalha yakariyakari wo uhiiwananiya. Attu nkayaakoha, “Ulha phi mpani?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nlhoko wa attu nkawaakhulha, “Ulha phi namilhohi Yesu o Unazareti yo Ugalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorwaa Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakelha Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkoomolha vathe attu onkhaye yaathumiha ni uthuma chittu mommo. Nkaapitikulhacha imeza cha attu yaakakaniha nchurukhu ni ihiche cha attu yaathumiha ikhunda, <verse number="13" style="v"/>nkeerelha, “Iholhepiya nhina Malhove Matakatifu wiira, Nlhuku heera, ‘Inupa aka inowa wiihaniya inupa yo ulhapelha.’ Nansho mwaattiva nhorukunusha ukhalha nikhuku no attu o uvara makhuche!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Attu o hoona ni attu o heeta nkayanrweelha Yesu u Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkaalhamihacha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni attu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa nkayaarushiya wo woona cho ushangiha chaapannge awe ni ashinamwane yeepachaka u Inupa ya Nlhuku yiiraka, “Hosana, uthimichiye Mwaana a Adaudi!” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi nkayankoha Yesu, “Chani, nnowiiwa chineera aya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Eiyo kinowiiwa. Chani khannashoma malhove alhepiye? ‘Wo malhaku a ashinamwane ni ashaana ashinkani unototopelhiya we ikekhiaye.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahiya, nkaakhuma vathe ni urwaa Ubethaniya nkaakhalha wowo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhava mwiri wo nkhuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mako 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe ahokolhiaka vawani mapikoosha, aari nawolhiye ithalha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkoona mwiri wo ntiini vacheshere iphiro, nkaachushera, nansho khaapwannye ittu ihikhalhe mathaakhururu. Paahi, nkeerelha mwiri uyo, “Uhimme maphepu tho mahuku onkhaye!” Vavawo vavawo mwiri uyo nkawooma. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Owiittucha yooneke nkayoomiya uwanoni yiiraka, “Mwiri ulha wuumilhe chani, vavawo vavawo?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, Mwakhalhaka ni nrima wo urumelhelha uhiri ni nipampa, nnowooria kuhena wo upangaru chiicho, nansho ata mweerelhaka ulha mwaako ulha, ‘Uthame weerihelhe ubaharini,’ chinopangia chiicho. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwakhalhaka ni nrima, chittu chiri choothe chinohalha inyu ulhepelha munlhapelhaka Nlhuku nnoovahiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukohereriya ikuru cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakelha tho Inupa ya Nlhuku, ni uyo vaari awe eetuchihaka, attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe vamoka ni ashulhupalhe nkayankoha, “Nnopanga chechi chittu chi wo ikuru ya apani? Apani yuvanheni chechi ikuru chi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ni mii kinoukohani nlhove nimoka, mwakaakhulhaka, ni mii kinouhimeriani kinopanga chechi chittu chi wo ikuru yaani. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Eti ikuru i Nayohana obatiiza yaakhumme uyi? Chani yaakumme wiirimu ama wa attu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho nkayaahalha olhumachaka ashineneru, “Nimwaakhulheke chani? Neeraka, ‘yaakhumme wiirimu, noonikoha, woonaka etu khamwaarumelhelha Nayohana ayo?’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vavawo neeraka, ‘yaakhumme wa attuni,’ ninowoova nlhoko wa attu ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye anorumelhelha wiira Nayohana anamilhohi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Paahi, nkayaamwaakhulha, “Khanichuwenlhe hii!”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni uyo Yesu nkaakhulha “Ni mii akinouhimeriani kimpanga chechi chittu chi wo ikuru yaani.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ashaana elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mwaattiva nnoona chani? Ahaawo ntu mmoka aari ni ashaana elhi. Nkaamwirelha mulhupalhe uyo, ‘Mwaamwanaka, lhelho urweeke wavare ntheko imata yo zabibu.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mmirawo uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Akinottuna!’ Nansho vahipincheru nkaarukunusha nulhumo nawe, nkaarwa uvarani ntheko. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yayo athithi ayo nkaarwa wa o nayelhi uyo nkaamwirelha chiichammo, ni uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Eiyo thithi!’ Nansho khaarwelhe unthekoni. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chani vavawo etu, wa yayo elhi ayo, phuuyi aathiminche athumwane?” Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Ulhe mwaana mulhupalhe ulhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Paahi, Yesu nkaahimeria wiira, “Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o ishembwere anowa yaakelha mu Imwene ya Nlhuku oholhelhakani. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Nayohana obatiiza ahowa uwaninyu uwonihani iphiro yo ikekhia, nansho mwaattiva khamwaarumelhenlhe, nansho attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o ishembwere yahaarumelhelha. Ata nnoonaka chi chonkhaye chi, mwaattiva khankhoromme ni urumelhelha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no imata yo zabibu ni anamalhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mwiiwelhelheke nlhikaaniho nikina. Ntu mmoka mwanene imata aalhilhe izabibu, nkarukureriha ukucho, nkaathipa ilhushi yo waamelha idivai, nkaatheka ishanja mommo. Amalheke nkaashimiha anamalhima, nkeeta nkwaha ilhapo yo utayi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ikatema yo nlhaalha yaphiyeke, nkaaruma anamitheko awe wa anamalhima alhe arwee apochere mahalha o nlhaalha. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nansho anamalhima alhe nkaayavara akarumiya ayo, nkayaamwata mmoka ni umwiiva nkina ni umwata malhuku nkina uyo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mwanene imata uyo nkaaruma tho anamitheko akina, enchi upwaha o upacha alhe, ni ayo nkayaapangelhiya thoko o upacha alhe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wo umalhihera nkanruma mwaamwanaya aanyiheraka wiira, ‘Anonlhoha mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nansho anamalhima alhe yamwooneke mwaamwanaya uyo nkayeerelhana ashineneru, ‘Ulha vano phi mwaamwanaya anene imata nohalha ukhalha phi mwanene nhakhu. Haya nngwe nimwiiveke etu, nipatte hii nhakhu awe uyo!’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Paahi etu, nkayammara, nkayankakhelha vachereshere imata yo zabibu nkayaamwiiva.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Vanova vavawo etu, mwanene imata yo zabibu uyo vanohalha awe uwa nohalha waapangelhani yayo anamalhima ayo?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nkayaamwaakulha, “Noweeva yayo attu o uhilhoka ayo, ni imata yo zabibu iyo nowaashimiha attu akina anohalha ummaha mahalha nlhaalha vanohalha aya uphiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Chani, khannashoma Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nlhuku nikhotiye ni atheki wiira khaninlhoka</para>
  <para style="q">Nihokhalha vano nlhuku no nsingi no vakhoonani.</para>
  <para style="q">Athithi phi pangilhe nenna nlhove nna,</para>
  <para style="q">Ninno niri no ushangiha chinene uwanihu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Wo chiichammo etu, kinouhimeriani wiira Umwene wa Nlhuku unookushiya ni uvahiya attu ahiri Ayahudi, anohalha wiima maphepu oombone.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Nohalha uwulhuwelha nenno nlhuku nno nowunthakiacha, ni nno nammulhuwelhaka ntu riyoothe, ninonhararia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo yeeweke yayo malhikaaniho ayo, nkayaachuwelha wiira aachiya ayo. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu nkayaahalha yaaviaka iphiro yo unhelha mmachirini, nansho yaari yoovaka attu wo nlhatu no uchuwelhiya wiira Yesu aari namilhohi.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no yolhia yo waarusini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha tho nlhove no ulhikaaniha voolhumana awe attu eeraka, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Umwene wo wiirimu uholhikaana ni mwene anterekhenlhe mwaamwanawe ikaramu ya arusi.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi, nkaaruma anamitheko avire eehanaka attu yaalhalheiye wa arusini, nansho yayo attu yaalhalheiye ayo khaattunne uwa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nkaaruma tho anamitheko akina, eeraka, mwaahimerieke attu alhalheiye u arusini ayo wiira, Ikaramu ihaaya, madume ni ikhondoro chihohithiya, awaacheke u arusini vano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nansho attu yaalhalheiye ayo khayaalhohilhe, nkayaathepa uvaracha mitheko chaya. kila mmoka, nkaarwa waakelhenlhe awe, mmoka umatani wawe, nkina uthumihani maronda awe, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ni akina nkayaavara akarumiya ayo ni waapangelha chittu cho uhilhoka ni uweevakacha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Amwene ayo nkayaarushiya chinene, nkayaaruma manyaasikari aya arwee yeevakache yayo attu o niiviho ayo ni upaha mooro iwani chaya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Amalheke, nkeerelha akarumiya aya, ikaramu ya arusi ihaaya kataashiru, nansho alhalheiye ayo khawaachilhe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi etu, nrweeke etu mmaphironi, mwaalhalhieke attu ariyoothe anohalha inyu waaphwanya awaacheke u arusini. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Anamitheko alhe nkayaathama, nkayaarwaa mmaphironi waarumiye aya, nkayaawiihacha attu onkhaye, attu orera nrima ni attu o uhilhoka nrima, nkayaakhalhacha, inupa nkayaachara alheto too.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Amwene vaakenlhe aya uwaakohachani alheto, nkaamwona ntu mmoka ahawanre isaare ya arusi hokhalha mwommo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Amwene nkayankoha, ‘Mpwana ukenlhe chani mu ni uwe khurina isaare ya arusi?’ Nansho uyo nkaamalha yii. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vavawo amwene nkeerelha anamitheko, ‘Munttukeke mieto ni miono munkakhelheke vathe wiipiphini. Wowo nokowunlha ni ukhuura miino.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamalhiha wo wiira, “Attu enchi aholhalheiya, nansho attu vakani phi thanlhiye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhiva ikhodi wa Amwene o Urumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-27">Luk 20:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayaarwaacha, nkayeewanana iphiro inolhoha aya ummara Yesu wo malhove awe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi, nkayaaruma owiittucha aya vamoka ni attu anttwara nlhoko wa Naherode. Nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, wo ikekhiaye nihochuwelha wiira inyuva phi ntu omanya, ni wiira nnohimiacha Ikeekhene ya Nlhuku. Khannomwoova ntu riyoothe, ukhalhawaya ikuru ya ntu khava ittu uwaninyu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Haya, etu nnihimerie chinoona inyu. Chani, vahorera waalhiva ikhodi Nakaisari ama khinorera?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha yoyo unafiki waya uyo, nkeerelha, mwaattiva anafiki, woonaka nnookilhikacha? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkooniheke etu nchurukhu unlhivelhiya ikhodi uyo. Ni ayo nkayakumiha nikhobilhi nimoka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi, Yesu nkaakoha, “Ikhove ilha ni nchina nna na apani?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nkayaamwaakulha, “Ya Nakaisari.” Vavawo Yesu nkeerelha, “Paahi, iri ya Amwene avahiyeke Amwene, ni ya Nlhuku avahiyeke Nlhuku.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yeeweke chiicho nkayoomiya uwanoni nkayanhiya nkayaarwaacha.</para>
  <para style="s">Meettuchiho o mwaha wo Uhihimmwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku nno, Amasadukayo akina aneera wiira attu akhwilhe kanohihimmwa nnookhwani nkaawacha wa Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha, ashinna Musa yenre ntu thenlhe akhwaaka wo uhahiya ashaana, nhimawe akelheke manupa annyarelheke ashaana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi, ahaawo attu saba. O upacha ahothelha nkaakhwa wo uhaahiya ashaana, nhima aya nkaakhelha manupa wa anankhwelhi ayo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkayeera chiicho wo manyaattu o nayelhi, ni o neraru, mpaka o saba aamalhihera. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yamalheke onkhaye ukhwaacha, opani ayo ni ayo nkayaakhwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vano etu, nihuku no uhihimushiya akhwilhe nno, anankhwelhi ayo anohalha ukhalha ahanu apani? Ukhalhawaya ahopacha uthelhiya ni attu onkhaye saba ayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhowonya mwaattiva ayi! Ukhalhawaya khanchuwenlhe Malhove Matakatifu mena ikuru cha Nlhuku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya attu akhwilhe vanohalha aya uhihimushiya khanowa aathelha mena uthelhiya, anohalha ukhalha thoko minepa o wiirimu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nansho inaacha uhihimmwa wa attu akhwilhe, chani khannashoma mwaahimeriye inyu ni Nlhuku? Mwanene aheera, <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Mii phi Nlhuku a Aburahimu, Nlhuku a Naisaka ni Nlhuku a Nayakhobo!’ Paahi, yoyo kahiwe Nlhuku a attu akhwilhe, nansho Nlhuku a attu akumi.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Attu yeeweke chiicho, nkayaashangihiya wo meettuchiho awe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlheheriyo nulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mako 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Amafarisayo yeeweke wiira Yesu hamaalhiha Amasadukayo, nkayathukumana vamoka, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mmoka aya, ntu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa, nkankoha Yesu wo unlhikacha, <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Owiittuchiha, nlheheriyo naani niri nulhupalhe nhina Malhehero a ashinna Musa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwaakhulha, “ ‘Mwaattune Athithi Nlhuku inyu wo nrima inyu wonkhaye, ni wo nnepa inyu wonkhaye ni wo irusho chinyu chonkhaye.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nna phi nlheheriyo nulhupalhe ni phi no upacha. <verse number="39" style="v"/>No nayelhi ninolhikaana ni nno, ‘Munttune nomwaatamana inyu thoko chinettuna inyu mwaanene.’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Malhehero a ashinna Musa onkhaye ni meettuchiho a anamilhohi anokhulhuvelha alha malheheriyo melhi alha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhove ninomwaacha Kuristo Moopolhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Amafarisayo vaathukumanne aya vamoka, Yesu nkaakoha, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mwaattiva nnochuwelha chani mwaha unomwaacha Kuristo Moopolhi? Chani, yoyo iyari ya apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Mwaana a Adaudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Paahi inooria chani wiira wo ikuru cho Iphumu ya Nlhuku Adaudi amwihane yoyo Thithi?”</para>
  <para style="p">“Ukhalhawaya aheera,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>‘Athithi aherelha Athumwanaka,</para>
  <para style="q">Nkhalheke wiimonono waka,</para>
  <para style="q">Mpaka vanohalha aka waathalha amalhaponi inyu wuuthi inyaa chinyu.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Paahi, yakhalhaka Adaudi ahomwiihana yoyo ‘Thithi’ inooriacha chani etu ukhalha mwaamwanaya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Khaariwo ntu riyoothe onrie umwaakhulha nlhove. Ni toka nenno nihuku nno khaawo ntu aalhikanche tho unkoha ittu.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakuphulhacha owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mako 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Amalheke Yesu nkaahimeria nlhoko wa attu ni owiittucha awe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo ahanaa ikuru yo ulhamulha Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, nvarechesheke ni uttwara nlhove niriyoothe ninohalha aya uwiirelhani, nansho nhithakihe chinopanga aya, ukhalhawaya khanopanga chineettuchiha aya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Anoottuka misigo cho ulhemelha ni waathatha attu mmakhathani, nansho ashinene ahittunaka wookolha inakhalhaka nikokho wiira akushe chechiyo misigo chiyo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yayo anopanga mitheko chaya chonkhaye wiira yooniye ni attu. Anowara itepe chilhepiye Malhehero a ashinna Musa mmiononi ni ukhanulha miono cho miinjiro chaya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Anothananacha ukhalha mapuro o urera mwaattuni ni ihiche cho nthimicho mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Anoteelhiya ukohachiya wo nthimicho vanopangiya maronda ni uchivelhiya wiihaniya ni attu, ‘Owiittuchiha.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho mwaattiva nhiteelhiye wiihaniya ‘Owiittuchiha,’ ukhalhawaya Owiittuchiha arii amoka tu, ni mwaattiva onkhaye nri attu o nlhoko mmoka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mena nhimwiihane ntu riyoothe velhaponi va, ‘Thithi’ ukhalhawaya athumwaninyu ari amoka tu, arii wiirimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mena nhiihaniye ‘Aholhelhi,’ ukhalhawaya nholhelhi inyu ri mmoka tu, phi Kuristo Moopolhi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Rii mulhupalhe munlhokoni mwinyu yoyo akhalheke phi karumiya inyu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neewelhiha nookurushiya, neekurusha noowelhihiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaamuka uhiya wiipanga o rera nrima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mako 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni inyu Amafarisayo! Mwa anafiki inyu! Nnootiyelhelha nlhako wo umwene wo wiirimu vamiithoni va attu. Mwaashinene nhikelhaka mpaani, mena khannaahulhelha attu anthanana ukelha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo! Nneepanga o urera nrima! Nnoonelha anankhwelhi ni wi chootheriha ukhalha attu o nrima woombone wo ulhapelha wo malhove menchi. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu nnoowa mwaatwarushiya wo uweria.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu mwaatti o nkutiro wa owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo! Mwa anafiki! Nneetakacha ubaharini ni velhaponi mumpatte ntu o uttwara meettuchiho inyu. Vanompatta inyu, nnonttekiha velhi wiira atikhelhiye vamooroni Ujehannamu, o uhiyakani mwaashinene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu aholhelhi ohoona! Mwaattiva nneera eti ntu alhupelhaka Inupa ya Nlhuku, naapo nawe khani ittu, nansho alhupelhaka wo idhahabu iri Nnupani mwa Nlhuku, naapo nno ninommara. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwaattiva ohoona o uphupuwalha! Ittuni iri yoombone chinene, idhahabu ama Inupa ya Nlhuku inohapiha idhahabu iyo? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tho nneettuchiha wiira, ‘Ntu alhupelhaka wo madhubahu, khava ittu, nansho alhupelhaka wo izawadi yeeshiye vamadhubahuni, nenno naapo nno ninommara.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwaattiva ohoona va! Ittu yaani iri yoombone chinene, izawadi ama madhubahu anohapiha izawadi ithimichiye iyo? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ntu nolhupelha vamadhubahuni holhupelha wo madhubahu ayo, ni wo ittu chonkhaye cheeshiye vachulhu waya, <verse number="21" style="v"/>ni ntu alhupelhaka wo ulhupelha Inupa ya Nlhuku, holhupelha wo yeyo Inupa ya Nlhuku iyo, ni wa Nlhuku, nokhalha nhina mwaya, <verse number="22" style="v"/>ni ntu alhupelhaka irimu, holhupelha varii ihiche yo Umwene ya Nlhuku ni wa Nlhuku nokhalha vachulhu waya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Nhothapana, inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo! Mwa anafiki! Nnaalhiviha attu isadaka yo nifungu no khumi, ata yo mathaakhuru o nihiriri noonukhelha, manjano ni ijira, uno nhiyaka chittu cho uchuwania cho Malhehero a ashinna Musa, ikiriri ni upisha nrima ni ukhulhuvelhiya. Kinouhimeriani wiira alha phi ayo mwaathananiye inyu uvarelhelha chinene, nhilhiyalhaka makina ayo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Aholhelhi ohoona! Nnothamiha iphepelhe iri nhina cho uwuriya, nansho mmiriaka ingamiya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo va! Mwa anafiki! Nnohapiha ikahi ni inyipo wo vathe, nansho nnohiya nhina chinananre chittu cho nanrokotolhe ni chittu chipante inyu wo uhichooria winyu, wo waathurulha attu ni ilhema. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Afarisayo ohoona inyu! Nhapiheke ikahi nhina thoko ni vathe vawo vanoorera chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo! Mwa anafiki! Nri thoko mahiye ahikiye ishwaakara wo vathe yooniaka orera, nansho nhina anachanre makhuva a attu akhwilhe ni kila ittu iri yo unanara. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wo vathe mwaattiva nnoonia ni attu thoko attu o nrima woombone, nansho nhina anafiki ni o nrima wo uhilhoka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhohera uttwaruwa unowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Nhothapana mwaatti owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo! Mwa anafiki va! Nnothekelha mahiye a anamilhohi ni ushiringa mahiye a attu orera nrima. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mwiiraka wiira yakaari mwahokhalha yeyo ikatema ya ashulhupalhe ihu iyo, khamwaakaviha chittu chenre aya, weevakacha anamilhohi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu, nnowiihimiechesha wiira mwaattiva mwaashinene phi ashaana a attu yeevilhe anamilhohi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Haya etu, mmalhihereke ntheko waachokholhiye ni ashulhupalhe inyu! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Inyu nri inwaa ni iyari yo inwaa! Nnoorieke chani ushemba ihukumu yo mooro wo Ujehannamu? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Phi nlhatu etu, mii kinouwiherani mwaattiva anamilhohi ni attu o irusho ni owiittuchiha, mmwaaka mweevaka ni waakhomelhelhacha akina aya, ni waatakacha ikopo mu inupa chinyu cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni waavia avia kila iwani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, utwarushiya wo nlhatu no weeva attu o rera nrima vahirii nlhatu, unowupatani wo nlhatu no iphome aya. Eiyo, toka urihia wo iphome i Nahabilu ahaattenke, mpaka ya Nazakariya, mwaana a Abarakiya, mweevilhe inyu iriyari yo madhubahu u Inupa ya Nlhuku. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wo ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani tho wiira, utwarushiya waya alha attu o niiviho alha unoowa waawulhuwelhaka attu a alha mahuku alha!</para>
  <para style="s">Ilhapo yo Uyerusalemu chenre aya wo uttuniya ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Uyerusalemu! Uyerusalemu! Nneeva anamilhohi nnaata malhuku akarumiya arumiye ni Nlhuku uwaninyu! Vachani kilhikanche aka waathukumaniha ashaana inyu uwannyaka, thoko nankutu chinaathukumaniha awe achishaana awe mmapuphani mwawe, nansho khamwaattunne. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Haya etu, Inupa inyu ya Nlhuku inoohiiya mathalha. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani uchokholha nna va wiira, khannokoona tho, mpaka ikatema vanohalha inyu wiira ‘Avahiye ibarakha uyo nowa wo nchina ni Athithi uyo.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nohimiacha mwaha wo uphomolhiya Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ahokhuma Inupa ya Nlhuku, owiittucha awe vaawilhe aya nkayaamoniha manupa o Inupa ya Nlhuku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Eiyo, nnowoona alha manupa onkhaye alha! Ikekhia kinouhimeriani, khaninhalha ata nlhuku nimoka ninohalha uhalha vaa vachulhu nikina, kila nlhuku ninowa uwulhushiya vathi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uhuva ni mahuviho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe nakhanlhe vachulhu Mwaako wo Mizeituni, owiittucha yahonttwara untemerani, nkayaamwirelha, “Nnihimerie yoyo mwaha uyo unohalha ukhumelhelha iyaakhani? Ni ithikineha chani chinohalha ukhumelhelha unichuwelhiha uwa winyu ni umalha wo ilhapo?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwiishungeke nhiwe mwaathepiachiya ni ntu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya attu enchi anowa aakhumelhelha eeraka kila mmoka wiira phi Kuristo ni ayo anoowa yaapoteriha attu enchi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nnoowa mweewa mwaha ikhoto ni itetesi cho ikhoto, nansho nhihuvihachiye. Ukhalhawaya yayo ahothananiya ukhumelhelha, nansho umalha unene uhinaaya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nikosho nimoka inoowa yaatakana ni nikosho nikina, umwene mmoka unowa waatakana ni umwene nkina. Ikuruna ni utetemelha wo ilhapo unoowa waakhumelhelha vawo ni valhe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yayo onkhaye ayo ari thoko nkuri wo uweria wo wiittukulha mwaana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Yamalhaka nnoowa mwaavariya mwapangelhiye ichimwa ni wiiviya. Makosho onkhaye anoowa aarushiya wo nlhatu wo nchina naka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu enchi anoowa aahiya mirima chaya, anoowa aathumihana ni uvengana ashineneru. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Anoowa aakhumelhelha anamilhohi o woothacha enchi anohalha waapoteriha attu enchi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Uhilhoka wa attu unoowa wunchereria, ni uttunana wa attu unowa uwolha. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho ntu riyoothe noohalha uvilhelha mpaka umalhelha yoyo phi nohalha woopolhiya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho umalhelha uhinaya uphiya, alha Malhove Orera o Umwene wa Nlhuku alha, anoowa aahimiachiya ilhapo yonkhaye wo uhimiechesha wo attu onkhaye, vavawo umalhelha wo makosho phi nohalha aya uwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uhuva wulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Nnoowa mwoona ‘Nrusho no utanganya’ naahimiye ni anamilhohi Nadanieli ninemenlhe vamapuroni vatakatifu, noshoma achuwelheke maana aya! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vavawo, arii Uyudea attawelheke umiakoni. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ntu rii vanchaarani hikhuruwe vathi uukushani ittu mpaani mwawe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ntu rii umatani hihokolhie uwani ukusha ikuwo awe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ahothapana manyopani anohalha ukhalha ve iruttuni ni manyopani anaamwiha yayo mahuku ayo! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Munlhapelheke Nlhuku wiira uttawa winyu uhiwe nlhaalha wo uririya ama Nihuku no Wiittuwa! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya uhuva wo yeyo ikatema iyo unolhoha ukhalha wulhupalhe uhinapacha woonia toka woopiya ilhapo mpaka lhelho nna. Mena kunowa waakhumelhelha tho. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho Nlhuku homalha uwukulha yayo mahuku ayo, ahakaawukulhiye, khaawo ntu riyoothe akoopolhiye. Nansho wo nlhatu ni attu athanlhiye etu, Nlhuku noowa aawukulha yayo mahuku ayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, ntu owirelhakani yayo mahuku ayo, ‘Kuristo rii vaa’ ama ‘rii valhe,’ nhinrumelhelhe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya anoowa aakhumelhelha ashi kuristo o woothacha ni anamilhohi o woothacha, anoowa upanga cho ushangiha chulhupalhe ni woopiha cho waarimelhiha ata attu athanlhiye ni Nlhuku, yooriachaka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwiiwelhelheke etu, mii kinowaamukani mahuku ahinaya uphiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Paahi etu yowiirelhakani, ‘Mummweheke, rii uthakoni!’ Nhirumelhelhe, ama yeeraka ‘Mmweheke, eevinthe vaa!’ Nhirumelhelhe mena. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu nohalha uwa thoko chineera aya wo uverunya vanomwalhelha aya unosha nchuwa mpaka uneelha nchuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Vari ntembo, phi vakittu vanothukumana marepo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uwa wo Mwaana a Ntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Wamalhakaru uhuva wo yayo mahuku ayo, nchuwa ninohelhiya ipiphi, mweeri khunowa waapharelha, ittotwa chinoomora wiirimu, ni machiri o wiirimu anoowa aatikhinyiya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ithikineha yo Mwaana a Ntu inoowa woonia wiirimu, ni makosho onkhaye o velhaponi anoowa aachukulhacha vanohalha aya umwoona Mwaana a Ntu awaaka vachulhu mahute o wiirimu wo ikuru ni nthimicho mulhupalhe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nrombe nulhupalhe no mapalhapata ninowa uruma, ni uyo noowa waaruma minepa o wiirimu awe avire mithelha micheshe cho iphioo, ni waathukumaniha attu athanlhiye ukhuma mithelha chonkhaye ncheshe cho ilhapo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no nkhuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mwiiittucheke etu malhikaaniho o mwiri wo nkhuyu. Maritta vanophuwa aya mathaakhuru, vavawo phi nochuwelha inyu wiira, ilhimwe ihaatameria. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu, mwaattiva vanohalha inyu woona alha onkhaye alha apangiaka, mmweeke mwaachuwelha wiira ikatema ihaaya, wa ayo ukhumelhelha. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wo ikekhiaye muupuwelheke wiira ulha mwaha wonkhaye ulha, unohalha ukhumelhelha ilha iyari ilha ihinavira. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Irimu ni ilhapo chinoovira, nansho malhove aka khanovira mena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Khaawo ntu chuwenlhe nihuku mena ikatema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mako 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Khaawo ntu chuwenlhe, nihuku mena ikatema, inolhoha uwa yaakhani, anakhalhaka minepa o wiirimu, mena Mwaana. Athithi vekha aya phi chuwenlhe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Uwa wa Mwaana a Ntu unohalha ukhalha thoko chenre aya ikatema ya Anuhu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mahuku igarika ihinaphiya, attu yaari alhiaka ni uwuria, athelhaka ni uthelhiya, mpaka nihuku Anuhu vaakenlhe aya ikalhava yuulhupalhe, isafina, <verse number="39" style="v"/>attu khayaachuwenlhe irini mpaka maashi o igarika vaawilhe aya, nkayaakusha onkhaye. Chiicho phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku Mwaana a Ntu vanolhoha awe uwa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo attu elhi anowa ukhalha umatani, mmoka noochishiya, ni nkina noohiya. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Manyopani elhi anowa ushilha vamoka, mmoka nowa ukushiya, nkina nowa uhiiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Paahi etu nshiheke, ukhalhawaya khanchuwenlhe nihuku no uhokolhia Athithi inyu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mwanene inupa akaachuwenlhe nihuku noowa attu owiiya, nchuwelheke wiira anshelhelhiha, mena kaahiya inupa awe iphomolhiye. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, ni inyu mwaatti nkalheke tayari, ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu nolhoha uwa ikatema ihinaanyihera inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Namitheko o ukhulhuvelhiya ni o uhikhulhuvelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Phi mpani etu, rii karumiya o ukhulhuvelhiya, o irusho? Ri ntu novahiya ntheko ni anene ntheko, wo weemelhelha akhunanawe ni waavaha cholhia ikatema yaayaka. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Horeeriya yoyo karumiya nohalha uphwanyiya ni mwanene ntheko apangaka ntheko awe rata vanohokolhia aya uwani! <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, mwanene ntheko uyo nommaha yoyo karumiya uyo ntheko wo weemelhelha nhakhu awe wonkhaye. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nansho akhalhaka karumiya o uhikhulhuvelhiya, nowiichirelha munrimani mwawe wiira, anene ntheko kanohokolhia phiyaru, <verse number="49" style="v"/>nkaachokholha waatakacha anamitheko akhunanawe, nkaalhia cholhia chiyo vekha awe ni uwuria vamoka ni attu o uhapalhiya. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nansho mwanene ntheko noohokolhia nihuku nihinoweherera awe ni isaa ihichuwenlhe awe. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Phi vavawo mwanene ntheko, vanowa awe untwarusha, ni umweesha nlhoko mmoka ni anafiki. Wowo phi nohalha aya ukhalha ikutto ni ushilha miino.”</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho na imialhi khumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Yeyo ikatema iyo, Umwene wo wiirimu unowa ulhikaana ni mialhi khumi yaakunshe ikhandiri chaya, nkayaarwaa u wekamelhani abwana arusi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Athanu aya yaari o uhikhalha ni irusho ni athanu yaari o irusho. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Athanu o uhikhalha ni irusho ayo yaakunshe akhandiri aya wo uhikusha makhura a akhiba, <verse number="4" style="v"/>nansho o irusho ayo yahokusha makhura a akhiba nchuupani vamoka ni ikhandiri chaya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abwana arusi nkaacherewa uwa, imialhi alhe onkhaye nkayaarupacha ikhove.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Uhiyu iriyari nkaneewiya nlhove nikhuwelhaka wiira, ‘Haya abwana arusi ahowa! Nrwee mweekamelhe!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vavawo imialhi onkhaye nkayonkwacha, nkayaaparihelha ikhandiri chaya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imialhi o uhikhalha ni irusho ayo nkayerelha imialhi o irusho alhe, ‘Nnivaheke makhura inyu vakani, ukhalhawaya ikhandiri chihu chihotiphiaa.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nansho o irusho alhe nkayaakhulha, ‘Khanthosha ari vakani, mbaya nrweeke unothumihiya aya mwathumeke mwaashinene!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Paahi, imialhi o uhikhalha ni irusho alhe nkayaarwaa uuthumani makhura, vaarwaa aya, abwana arusi nkayaawa. Imialhi yaari tayari alhe, nkayaakelha mpaani vamoka ni ayo, inupa ya arusi, nkhora nkawaatteiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Vahipinche imialhi akina ayo nkayaahokolhia, nkayeehana, ‘Pwiiya, abwana arusi, pwiiya abwana arusi! Nnihulhelhe!’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Nansho abwana arusi ayo nkayaakhulha, ‘Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, akuuchuwenlheni mwaattiva.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yamalheke Yesu nkeera, “Nshelhelhiheke etu, ukhalhawaya khanchuwenlhe nihuku mena ikatema.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhikaaniheriya anamitheko araru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Yeyo ikatema iyo Umwene wo wiirimu unowa ukhalha thoko ntu mmoka aathananne urwaa nkwaha wo utayi, nkeehana anamitheko awe, nkaaruma ntheko wo weemelhelha nhakhu awe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkammaha kila mmoka ntheko wo ulhikaana chinooria awe, mmoka nhakhu ichipande cho italanta nthanu ni nkina italanta pilhi ni nkina italanta imoka thoko chooria awe. Amalheke nkaarwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Karumiya aavahiye nhakhu italanta nthanu nkaapanga maronda nkaapatta italanta chikina nthanu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ni chiichammo ntu aavahiye nhakhu italanta pilhi nkaapatta italanta chikina pilhi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nansho ntu aavahiye italanta imoka nkaarwa uuthipelhani vathi, nkaavitha nhakhu wa mwanene uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Yavireke mahuku menchi, mwanene ntheko ulhe nkaahokolhia, nkaachokholha waalhakelha nhakhu awe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Karumiya aavahiye nhakhu italanta nthanu nkaawa ni italanta nthanu chikina. Nkeera, ‘Pwiiya mwaakivanhe italanta nthanu. Mwooneke etu, kihopatta italanta nthanu chikina.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwanene ntheko nkeera, ‘Morera, anamitheko oombone ni o ukhulhuvelhiya! Nhokhulhuvelhiya wo nhakhu vakani, vano etu kinouhiyerani ntheko mulhupalhe. Mmweeke etu niwe naapuha vamoka ni mii!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Karumiya aavahiye nhakhu italanta pilhi nkaawa, nkaakumiha italanta pilhi chikina chaayarinhe awe nkeera, ‘Pwiiya mwaakivanhe italanta pilhi. Mwooneke etu italanta chikina chipantte aka.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwanene ntheko nkaamwirelha, ‘Morera, anamitheko oombone ni o ukhulhuvelhiya. Nhokhalha o ukhulhuvelhiya wo nhakhu vakani, vano kinouhiyerani ntheko mulhupalhe. Mmweeke etu, mmwe mwaapuha vamoka ni mii.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nansho namitheko aavahiye italanta imoka nkaawa, nkeera, ‘Pwiiya, kihochuwelha wiira inyuva nri attu orikarika, inyuva nnokhungura vahaanlhe inyu, ni ukukhulhulha vahaamwanche inyu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kahoova, nkakaavitha nhakhu inyu vathi. Mmwieke etu nhakhu inyu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mwanene ntheko nkaamwirelha, ‘Uweva uri karumiya o uhilhoka ni uhuva! Uhochuwelha wiira mii kinokhungura vakittu vahaanlhe aka, ni ukukhulhulha vahimwanche aka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Paahi etu, waaphwanelhiye weesha nchurukhu aka unoshungiya nchurukhu, ni mii kaanopatta nchurukhu aka ni ifaida aya! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vano etu munthurulheke nchurukhu uyo, nkusheke nrweeke mwammaheke ulhe rina italanta khumi ulhe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya, ntu ri ni ittu noovahiya ni wunchereriya. Nansho ntu hirina ittu, hata ikani irinawe iyo inookushiya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho ulha karumiya o uhikhulhuvelhiya ulha, akakhelhiyeke vathe wiipiphini uwo! Wowo phi unohalha ukhalha ikutto ni ushilha miino.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Ihukumu yo umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Ikatema Mwaana a Ntu vanohalha awe uwa nari Mwene vamoka ni minepa o wiirimu atakatifu onkhaye, vavawo nowa aakhalha vahicheni vawe vo nthimicho, <verse number="32" style="v"/>ni attu o makosho onkhaye anowa uthukumana vari awe, ni uyo nowa waanyulhacha attu milhoko miilhi, thoko nshunga vanaanyulhacha awe ikhondoro ni ipuri. Ikhondoro mpatta mmoka wo wiimonono ni ipuri mpatta wo wiimushi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Noowa weesha attu anrumelhenlhe wiimonono wawe ni attu akina ahinrumelhenlhe wiimushi wawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yamalhaka Amwene anowa weerelha alhe arii mpatta wawe wo wiimonono, ‘Mmweeke mwaattiva nvahiye ibarakha ni Athithi! Mmweeke mwaapochera umwene mwesheriye inyu toka voopiye aya ilhapo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ulhalhawaya kahowolhiya ithalha ni inyu nkamwaakivaha yolhia, kahowolhiya nttona ni inyu mwaattiva mwahokivaha maashi, kaari nlheto ni mwaattiva nkamwaakipochera, <verse number="36" style="v"/>akawanre, nkamwaakiwariha, kaari ki nreta ni inyu nkamwaawa uukonani, kaari muuttukiyani ni inyu mwaattiva nkamwaawa ukishukuriani.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Vavawo, attu orera nrima anowa waakhulha Amwene, ‘Thithi, yaakhani nowonneni nnawolhiye ithalha ni hii nkanoovahani yolhia, ama nnari ni nttona ni hii nkanowurihani maashi? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ni yaakhani mwaari inyu alheto ni hii nkanoopocherani, ama mwaari wo uhikhalha ni ikuwo ni hii nkanoowarihani? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ama yaakhani nowonneni nnari areta ama nnattukiye ni hii nkanaawa uwoonani?’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Amwene anoowa waakhulha, ‘Ikekhia kinouhimeriani, kila ittu champangenlhe inyu mmoka aya ashilhoko aka akani aakirumelhenlhe alha, mwaakipangenlhe mii!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Amalhaka anowa weerelha attu arii mpatta waya wo wiimushi, ‘Nthamache vari aka inyu mwaatti nlhaviye ni Nlhuku va! Nrwaacheke uri mooro wo hitiphiaa mahuku o uhimalha wesheriye Nakare ni minepa chawe! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya kahowolhiya ithalha ni mwaattiva khamwakivanhe yolhia ni kaari ni nttona mwaattiva khamwakivanhe maashi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kaari nlheto mwaattiva khamwakipochenre ni kaari nreta ni ntu o ttukiye mwaattiva khamwaawilhe uukiwehani.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Vavawo attu ayo anowa ukoha, ‘Thithi, yaakhani nowonilhe inyu nnawolhiye ithalha ama nttona, nnari nlheto ama wo uhikhalha ni ikuwo, nnari areta, ni hii khanokavihenreni?’ <verse number="45" style="v"/>Amwene anowa waakhulha, ‘Kinouhimeriani ikekhia, kila vaakhonte inyu umpangelha ittu yoombone mmoka aya alha ashinkani alha, mwaakhonte ukipangelha mii.’ <verse number="46" style="v"/>Paahi, alha attu alha anowa urweehiya urii ntwarusho no uhimalha, nansho attu orera nrima alhe anowa urweehiya urii ukumi wo uhimalha.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Miruku cho umwiiva Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalhiheke wiittuchiha yayo meettuchiho onkhaye ayo, nkaahimeria owiittucha awe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nhochuwelha wiira mahuku melhi anowa, phi nihuku no Pasaka, ni Mwaana a Ntu nookumihiya akhomelhelhiye munsalaabani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe ahokumaana vamoka upuwani u Nakayafa, opochera ishaani olhupalhe, <verse number="4" style="v"/>nkayeewanana miruku cho unhelha Yesu mmachirini wo umwoonelha, amwiive. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nansho ewananne wiira, “Nihipange nenna nlhove nna ikatema yo Pasaka, ihiwe ikhumelhelhaka injoove mwaattuni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowootihiya makhura o unukhelha Ubethaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoha 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe Ubethaniya, uwani u Nasimoni, ntu o makutulha, <verse number="7" style="v"/>opani amoka aawelhe ichupa yo malhuku o alabasta yo makhura o unukhelha o nchurukhu mwinchi, nkayaawa wa Yesu vamezani vaakhalha awe ulhia yolhia. Nkaamminelha makhura ayo mmuruni. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkoona yeyo nkayaarushiya. Nkayaakoha, “Yeeshiyani urihakacha alha makhura alha? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Makhura thoko alha anthumihiya wo nchurukhu mwinchi, ni nchurukhu uyo waanooria uvahiya attu amashikini.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha chaanyihera aya, nkaahimeria, “Woonaka nnowahuviha alha opani alha? Yayo ahokipangelha ittu yoombone. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Attu ahirina ittu ari mahuku onkhaye vamoka ni inyu, nansho mii akinkhalha vamoka ni inyu mahuku onkhaye. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Alha opani alha ahokimiinelha makhura o unukhelha wo weesha iruttu aka tayari wo nihuku no uvithiya waka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vano etu, kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, vakittu variwoothe velhaponi va vanohalha uhimiachiya alha Malhove Orera alha, mwaha upangilhe aya alha opani alha, unowa uhimiachiya wo wuupuwelhiya waya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nayuda anorumelhelha unthumiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yamalheke Nayuda Isikariote, mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi, nkarwa wa attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe, <verse number="15" style="v"/>nkeerelha, “Nnohalha ukivaha ittu yaani kanthumihaka Yesu uwaninyu?” Nkayaamwalhakelha nchurukhu makhobilhi makhumi mararu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ni toka yeyo ikatema iyo Nayuda nkaavia nipesha no unthumiha Yesu wa attu opochera isadaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhia Pasaka vamoka ni owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nihuku naaholhelha nihuku no Pasaka, nihuku no mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure, owiittucha yahonttwara Yesu nkayankoha, “Nnothanana nooterekhelhekeni vayi yolhia yo Pasaka?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nrweeke wa ntu mmoka urii iwani mwanhimerieke, ‘Owiittuchiha aneera, ikatema aka ihophiya, mii ni owiittucha aka ninowa unlhelhia Pasaka uwaninyu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayeera thoko Yesu chaalhehenre awe nkayaakoorosha yolhia yo Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Uchechilho, Yesu nkaakhalha vamezani vamoka ni owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi, <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vaari aya alhiaka, Yesu nkeera, “Kinouhimeriani ikekhia wiira, mmoka inyu nookithumiha.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayaachukulha chinene, nkayankohacha mmoka mmoka, “Thithi! Chani phi mii?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu nopapha nkatte vamoka ni mii nnyiponi phi yoyo nohalha ukithumiha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu noorwaa unkelha awe thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya, nansho hothapana ntu ulhe nolhoha unthumiha Mwaana a Ntu! Ikaari mbaya wa yoyo ntu uyo ahikaayarelhe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nayuda, aari phi ayo yaathanana unthumiha, nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha! Chani, phi mii?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyuva mwaanene nheeromolha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yolhia ya Athithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ako 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vaari aya alhiachaka, Yesu nkaakusha nkatte, nkaalhapelhelha wa Nlhuku, nkaamia, nkaavahacha owiittucha awe eeraka, “Mmwieke nlhieke, ilha phi iruttu aka.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Amalhiheke nkaathesha ikikombe yo idivai, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, nkaavahacha eeraka, “Mmwurieke onkhaye, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ilha phi iphome aka inotimiriha malhehano a Nlhuku, iphome aka inrihiaa wo nlhatu ni attu enchi wo uhiyereriya uwonya waya. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani, akinowuria tho idivai yo zabibu mpaka nihuku vanohalha aka uwuria idivai yo naanano vamoka ninyu mu Umweneni wa Athumwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vaamanlhe aya wiipa ichipo, nkayaathama, nkayaarwaa waari Mwako wo Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nohimiacha mwaha wo uruniya ni Napeturo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yamalheke Yesu nkeerelha, “Uhiyu wo lhelho ulha, mwaattiva onkhaye nnowa uttawa ni ukihiya, ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu anohimia wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kinoomwata nshunga</para>
  <para style="q">Ni ikhondoro chinoomwaria.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho baada yo uhihimmwa, kinouholhelhani Ugalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Napeturo nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Akinowa koohiyani, ata attu onkhaye anattawaka.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Ikekhia kinouhimeriani, ulha uhiyu ulha nthupi uhinaya wiipa, nnowa mwaakikhota vararu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayeera, “Ata yakhalhaka ukhwa, mbaya ni mii kikhwe vamoka ni inyu, akinookhotani mena.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni ayo owiittucha akina onkhaye nkayeera chiichammo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhepelha umatani Ugethsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yamalheke Yesu nkaarwa vamoka ni owiittucha awe waari imata yeehaniya Gethsemane, nkeerelha wiira, “Nkhalheke vaa ni mii kirwee vaholho vawo kalhapelhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nkaakusha Napeturo ni ashaana elhi a Nazebedayo. Ihuzuni ni uthemwa nkawanchokholha, <verse number="38" style="v"/>nkeerelha, “Nrima aka uhochariya ihuzuni yinchi, uthananaka ukiwulhusha. Nkhalheke vaa nshiheke vamoka ni mii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Paahi, nkaarwa miholho vakani, nkaawulhuwa makukhu, nkaalhapelha, “Thithi, yakhalhaka inoworiacha, ilha ikikombe ilha ikivire! Nansho ihikalhe thoko chinthanana aka mii, nansho chinottuna inyu inyuva mwaanene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nkaahokolhia vaari aya owiittucha, nkaaphwanyacha anarumpe. Nkeerelha Napeturo, “Chani khamwonrie ushelhelhiha vamoka ni mii inakhalhaka isaa imoka? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nshelhelhiheke ni ulhapelha nhiwe mwaakelha muulhikachiyani. Nrima uhottuna nansho iruttu inoohuperia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nkaarwa tho no nayelhi nkaalhapelha, “Thithi, yakhalhaka khinooriacha wiira, ilha ikikombe yo uweria ilha ikivire wo uhiwureria, paahi etu, chikhalheke thoko chinothanana inyu mwaanene.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nkaarwelha tho, nkaaphwanyacha anarupilhe, ukhalhawaya miitho aya aari anachanre ikhove.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Paahi, nkaahiyacha, nkaarwa tho ulhapelhani no neraru olhumachaka yayo malhove ayo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkaarwelha owiittucha, nkeerelha, “Chani, nri muurupani ni wiittuwa mpaka nna? Mwooneke! Ikatema vano ihophiya, ni Mwaana a Ntu nookumihiya wa attu o uwonya. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Munkweke etu, nirweeke. Ntu nokithumiha uyo ulha vaa howa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noovariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoha 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu aari olhumachaka ikatema Nayuda, owiittucha mmoka aya khumi ni elhi alhe vaawilhe aya. Vamoka ni ayo nkayaawa attu enchi arii ni maphanga ni indonga yaarumiye ni attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ntu anthumiha Yesu ahomalha waahimeria nlhove no uthikineha wiira, “Ulhe nohalha aka unkumbatira uyo, phi yoyo nothananiya. Mummareke!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Paahi, Nayuda nkaamwatameria Yesu, nkankohacha eeraka, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu Owiittuchiha!” Nkankumbatira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Mpwana, upangeke uwenlhe ao.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vavawo attu alhe nkayaawa, nkayammara Yesu, nkayanhelha mmachirini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka aari vamoka ni Yesu nkaatholholha mwaalho awe mulhupalhe, nkanthikilha nnyaru no wiimonono karumiya a Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, nkankwatulha. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nhokolhoshe uphanga inyu nnigonereni, ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe neeva wo uphanga, nookhwa wo uphanga. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira kaanooria waalhepelha Athithi, ni ayo wo uhipicha yankiwihera minepa o wiirimu milhoko cho upwaha milhoko khumi ni melhi? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nansho anohalha utimira chani Malhove Matakatifu anohimiacha wiira phi chiicho chinophwanelhiya aya chikhalhe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu nkaahimeria attu o nlhoko waawilhe ummarani, “Chani, mmwilhee ukivara ni mialho chulhupalhe ni indonga thoko wiira ki ntu o uvara makhuche? Kila nihuku kaari keettuchihaka attu wi Inupa ya Nlhuku, ni inyu khamwaakivanre! <verse number="56" style="v"/>Nansho alha onkhaye alha apangelhe wiira Malhove Matakatifu aalhempe aya anamilhohi atimire.” Yamalheke, owiittucha awe nkayanhiya nkayaattawacha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu umilhatuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mako 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoha 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Paahi, attu yammanre Yesu nkayanrweha upuwani u Nakayafa, Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, waathukumanne aya attu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa vamoka ni ashulhupalhe. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayanttwara wo utayi mpaka upuwani wa Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, nkayaakelha mpaani vamoka ni anamitheko nkayaakhalha vathi yoone chittu chinohalha aya wiira. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Paahi, Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe ni nkutiro wonkhaye nkayaavia nlhove no uhimiechesha woothacha, umootheria Yesu wiira amwiive, <verse number="60" style="v"/>nansho khayaapante nlhove niriyoothe no uhimiechesha, inakhalhaka yahowa attu enchi eepanga uhimiechesha wo malhove o woothacha. Wo umalhihera nkayaawa attu elhi o uhimiechesha, <verse number="61" style="v"/>nkayeera, “Ulha ntu ulha aheera, ‘Kinowooria uphomolha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni utheka tho wo mahuku mararu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayeemelha, nkayankoha Yesu, “Chani, woonaka khannaakhulha nlhove? Alha attu alha anohimiecheshani uwaachani?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaamalha yii. Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayaamwirelha, “Kinowulhupelhihani wa Nlhuku rii nkumi, nnihimerie yakhalhaka ikekhia inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi, Mwaana a Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha eeraka, “Eiyo inyuva nhohimia! Nansho kinouhimeriani mwaattiva onkhaye, toka vano nnoomwona Mwaana a Ntu nakhanlhe wiimonono wa Athithi, awaaka wo ikuru umahuteni wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Vavawo, Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkaahulha ikuwo chaya, eeraka, “Holhava! Ni rini vano tho yowaavia attu o uhimiechesha? Vano mwaatti nheewa mwaanene ulhava wawe. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Haya mwaatti nnoona chani?” Attu ayo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Hotteka, hophwanelhiya ukhwa!” <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkayanshuwelha ishenye wiitho, nkayaamwata makofi, ni attu akina nkayaamwata makofi chiicho, <verse number="68" style="v"/>nkayaamwiirelha, “Inyuva na Kuristo, nlhamulhelheke etu, mpani owatilheni!”</para>
  <para style="s">Napeturo anonruna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mako 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoha 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Napeturo yaari anakhanlhe vathe ulhuwanini karumiya mmoka nthiyana a Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe vaawilhe awe nkeera, “Ni inyu, chiicho, mwaari vamoka ni Yesu o Ugalilaya.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Napeturo nkaaruna vaattuni eeraka, “Akichuwelhe ittu inoolhumacha inyu.” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Nkaakhuma vathe, nansho vaakhuma aya, vankhorani, karumiya nkina nthiyana nkoona, nkeerelha attu yaari vavawo ayo, “Ulha ntu ulha aari vamoka ni Yesu o Unazareti.” <verse number="72" style="v"/>Napeturo nkaaruna tho eeraka, “Kinoolhupelha wiira akinchuwenlhe yoyo ntu uyo!” <verse number="73" style="v"/>Miholho vakani, attu yaari vavawo ayo, nkayaarwelha Napeturo, nkayeera, “We ikekhiaye, inyuva mwaari mmoka aya, ukhalhawaya nulhumo ninyu ninouhimiecheshani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Vavawo Napeturo nkayeera, “Kinoolhupelha wiira kinoolhumacha aka phi ikeekhene! Nlhuku akihukumulheke etu koothachaka! Akinchuwelhaka ulha ntu ulha!” Vahipinche nthupi nkaweepa. <verse number="75" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayoopuwelha malhove aahimeriye aya ni Yesu wiira, “Nthupi uhinaya wiipa, nnoowa mwaakiruna mikwaha miraru.” Paahi, nkaakhuma vathe, nkonlha chinene.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorweehiya u Napilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mako 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoha 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Washeeke waya attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe yahopanga miruku cho umwiiva Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkayanttuka mittondoro cho yuuma, nkayankusha, nkayanrweeha u Napilato yaari agavana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhwa u Nayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Mitk 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vavawo Nayuda, anthuminhe Yesu vonne aya wiira Yesu homalha uhukumulhiya, nkaachukulha munrimani, nkaarwa waahokolhoshera opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe makhobilhi makhumi mararu o nchurukhu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkeerelha, “Kihotteka wo unthumiha ntu hittenke eeviye.” Nansho ayo nkayaamwiirelha. “Hiyaano ninochuwelha chani yayo malhove ayo? Nlhatu inyu mwaanene.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nayuda nkayaarihelha makhobilhi o nchurukhu alhe mpaani u Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkayaathama, nkaarwa uwiittukelhelhani anene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayaakusha makhobilhi o nchurukhu ulhe, nkayeera, “Khavanorera weesha Nnupani mwa Nlhuku ulha nchurukhu ulha ukhalhawaya uri nchurukhu wo iphome.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Paahi, yeewananeke, nkayoopolha imata ya ntu oopa miapu vakhalhe vakittu vo uvithiya alheto. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phi nlhatu mpaka lhelho yeyo imata iyo ineehaniya imata yo iphome. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, malhove a anamilhohi Nayeremiya chaatiminre aya venre aya, “Yahokusha nchurukhu makhobilhi makhumi mararu, nhakhu waakumihiye ni attu o Israeli vewananne aya malhivo awe, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nkayoopolha imata ya ntu o wuupa miapu, thoko Athithi chaakilhehenre aya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Napilato anonkohakoha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mako 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoha 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkeemeshiya wa Aholhelhi o Urumi, ankonhe wiira, “Chani, inyuva phi Amwene a Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyuva nhohimia.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho khaakhunlhe ittu wo milhatu chaareiya awe ni attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Chiicho Napilato nkayankoha, “Chani, khannewa milhatu chonkhaye chinohimiya chuwaachakani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe ata nlhove nimoka, mpaka Napilato nkayoomiya uwanoni chinene.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohukumulhiya ukhwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoha 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Napilato ahokhalhana malhemalhelho ikatema yo Pasaka unhiyerera ntu ttukiye mmoka aathananiye ni attu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu vaahukumulhiya awe, ahaawo ntu ottukiya mmoka aachuwanelhe chinene, nchina nawe aari Baraba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Paahi attu vaathukumanne aya vamoka, Napilato nkayaakoha, “Mwaatti nnothanana kinhiyerereke mpani? Baraba ama Yesu neehaniya Kuristo?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Napilato yahochuwelha wiira aholhelhi a Ayahudi yanrwehilhe Yesu wo nlhatu no mwoonelha ihache.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Napilato vaari aya anakhanlhe vachulhu ihiche yo waahukumulhelha attu, ahanu aya nkayaarwehelha nttenga wiira, “Nhikhalhe ni nlhove niriyoothe ni uyo ntu orera nrima hittenke uyo, ukhalhawaya lhelho uhiyu kihothemwihiya chinene ntorani wo nlhatu nawe.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ashulhupalhe nkayapepechacha attu avekelhe wiira Baraba attukulhiye ni Yesu eeviye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho Napilato nkaakoha, “Phi mpani wa alha attu elhi alha nnothanana inyu kinhiyerere?” Attu nkayaakulha, “Ninonthanana Baraba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaakoha tho, “Vano, kimwiiriheke ittu yaani Yesu neehaniya Kuristo ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">Attu onkhaye nkayeera “Akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaathepa ukoha, “Wo nlhatu waani? Panngeni yo uhilhoka?” Attu nkayaathepa ukhuwelha, “Akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Paahi, Napilato yachuwelheke wiira khavanshichira tho, ni attu yaari achokholhaka uhelha injoove, nkayaawia maashi nkaanyawa mathatha aya vaattuni, nkayeera, “Mii akirina nlhatu vachulhulhu iphome awe ulha ntu ulha! Nlhatu winyu mwaashinene!” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayeera, “Iphome awe inihokolheelheke vachulhu wihu ni achishaana ihu!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vavawo Napilato nkayanhulhelha Baraba ukhuma waattukiye awe, nkaamwata Yesu ikopo ni waavaha Yesu akhomelhelhiye.</para>
  <para style="s">Manyaasikaari anompangelha Yesu ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mako 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoha 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yamalheke manyaasikari a Napilato nkayanrweeha Yesu mpaani, ni attu onkhaye nkayancharaanelha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nkayanrulha ikuwo chawe, nkayammwariha ikanzu yokhwilha. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkayaativa mphumburu wo miiwa, nkayammwariha mmuruni, nkayammariha nthalhe moono wo wiimonono. Nkayaakhoroma vaari awe, nkayampangelha mattepwa yiiraka, “Moyoo Amwene a Ayahudi!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nkayanshuwelha ishenye, nkayaakusha nthalhe ulhe, nkayaamwatelha mmuruni. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yamalheke umpangelhacha ncheche, nkayanrulha ikanzu ilhe, nkayammwariha ikuwo chawe. Nkayanrweha unkhomelhelhani munsalaabani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhomelhelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vaari aya arwaaka nkayankumaana ntu mmoka nchina nawe Simoni nnenchi o Ukirene, nkayanchuchumiha ni unkhanyereriha wiira akushe nsalaaba wa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yaphiyeke vakittu vaneehaniya Gologota, maana aya, “Nikhurukucha no muru.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkayammaha idivai yaathakanihiye ni ittu yo uhapalha, nansho Yesu alhawiheke khaawunrie.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nkayankhomelhelha vansalaabani. Yamalheke nkayaakawana ikuwo chawe wo woopa ikhura. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nkayaakhalha, anlhitelhelhaka. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vamuruni vawe, nkawaalhepiya milhatu chawe cheera, “Ulha phi Yesu, Mwene a Ayahudi.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nkayaakhomelhelha tho attu elhi o uvara makhuche, mmoka wiimushi ni nkina wiimonono.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Attu yaavira vavawo vakitu vawo ahopukhunyacha miuru ni unruwana eeraka, <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Inyuva! Ngati mweera nnowooria uphomolha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni utheka tho wo mahuku mararu! Mwiichoopolheke etu mwanene mwakhalhaka inyuva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku! Paahi, nkhuruweke vansalaabani vawo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wo yeyo iphiro iyo opochera ishaani olhupalhe vamoka ni attu owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni ashulhupalhe yahonnyoholhacha yeeraka, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Ahoopolha akina, nansho wiiyopolha khanooria wiiyopolha mwanene! Kahiwe phi yoyo Mwene a Ayahudi? Paahi, ooriaka wiikurusha vansalaabani, hii ninonrumelhelha! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ahonrumelhelha Nlhuku ni wiira eti yoyo phi Mwaana a Nlhuku, paahi, Nlhuku amwopolheke yakhalhaka nonttuna.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ni ayo o uvara makhuche akhomelhelhiye vamoka ayo, yahonruwanakacha chiicho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhwa vansalaabani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vaari aya saa sita uthana ilhapo yonkhaye nkayaakelhiya ipiphi, yaalhokenlhe wo isaa taaru. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yaphiyeke isaa tisa Yesu nkaakhuwelha wo nlhove nuulhupalhe eeraka, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakthani?” Maana aya, “Nlhuku aka, Nlhuku aka, woonaka nhookihiya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nansho attu yeemenlhe vavawo yeeweke chiicho nkayeera, “Neehana Naeliya.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mmoka aya nkaattimakacha, nkaakusha ndodoki, nkaanelhiha nsiikini, nkeesha munthalheni, nkammaha awurie.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nansho attu akina nkayeera, “Nhiye noone yakhalhaka Naeliya anowa uumopolhani.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Paahi, Yesu nkaakhuwelha tho, nkaahiya nrima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Vavawo nipaziya nulhupalhe no u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkanaahuwa ipaande pilhi, ukhuma nchulhu mpaka vathi. Ilhapo nkayaatetemelha, mialha nkachaphwiaa, <verse number="52" style="v"/>mahiye nkayaapatakuwa ni iruttu cha atakatifu enchi yaakhwilhe, nkachaahihimmwa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nkayaakhuma mmahiyeni, ni Yesu vaahihimmwe awe nkayaarwaa Iwani Itakatifu, nkayoonachiya ni attu enchi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Paahi, olhupalhe a manyaasikari ni manyaasikari yaariwo, anlhitelhelhaka Yesu yooneke ntetemelho no ilhapo ni attu aakhumelhenlhe, nkayoova chinene, nkayeera, “Ikekhiaye yolha ntu ulha aari Mwaana a Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Vavawo vakittu vawo yahawo manyopani enchi awehaka wo utayi. Yayo phi alhe yanttwarilhe Yesu ukhuma Ugalilaya ankavihaka ntheko. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mommo munlhokoni mwaya mmo yahaawo Amariamu Magidalena, Amariamu anumwanaya Nayakhobo ni Nayusufu, vamoka ni ahanu a Nazebedayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Uvithiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Uchechilho, nkaawa ntu mmoka o nhakhu nnenchi o Uarimathaya, eehaniya Nayusufu. Ni ayo chiicho aari owiittucha a Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Nkayaarwelha Napilato, nkayaalhepelha wiira avahiye iruttu ya Yesu. Paahi, Napilato nkayaalhehera wiira avahiye. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nayusufu ahokusha iruttu ilhe, nkaavilhikelhelha isaanda yorera yo hariri, <verse number="60" style="v"/>nkayaavitha mu nihiye no naanano naahemme aya vamwalhani. Amalheke nkaapirikisha nlhuku nulhupalhe utiya vanlhakoni, nkaarwa uwani. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Amariamu Magidalena ni Amariamu akina yaari anakhanlhe awehaka miitho unihiyeni.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhitelhelhiya nihiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Nihuku no nayelhi naari Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo nkayaakumaana ni Napilato, <verse number="63" style="v"/>nkayeera, “Pwiiya, nihoopuwelha wiira ulhe ntu othepiacha ulhe aheera hinaya ukhwa eti, ‘yaviraka mahuku mararu kinohihimmwa.’ <verse number="64" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu nlheehereke wiira nihiye nilhitelhelhiye mpaka nihuku no neraru, owiittucha awe ahiwe eiyaka iruttu awe, ni werelha attu wiira hohihimmwa. Woothacha wo umalhihera uwo unowa unanara upwaha wo upacha ulhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Napilato nkeerelha, “Haya etu, nrweeke mwakhalhelheke nihiye nno thoko chinoona inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Paahi, nkayaarwaa ulhitelhelhani nihiye, nkayaashiringa vachulhu nlhuku nne ni waahiya vavawo manyaasikari o lhitelhelha.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uhihimmwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mako 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Navireke Nihuku no Wiittuwa, mapikoosha o nihuku no jumaapili, Amariamu Magidalena ni Amariamu akina yahorwaa uwehani nihiye nne. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wo uhipicha nkawaakhumelhelha utetemelha wo ilhapo wo machiri, nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi wahokuruwa ukhuma wiirimu, nkawaapikirisha nlhuku ni ukhalhelha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Waaria waya waari thoko wo uverunya, ni ikuwo chawe chaari chootelha twetwetwetwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Attu yaalhitelhelha nihiye nkayaatetemelha wo woova chinene, nkayaakhalha thoko attu akhwilhe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawoolhumacha weerelha manyopani alhe, “Mwaatti nhoove, ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha wiira nnomwaavia Yesu, aakhomelhelhiye vansalaabani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Khaawo vaa, hohihimmwa, thoko chenre awe wo uhimia. Mmweeke mwoona vakittu veeshiye awe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Paahi, nrweeke chitema mwerelheke owiittucha awe wiira hohihimmwa ukhuma unookhwani, ni vano hooholhelhani urwaa Ugalilaya, wowo nnokoomwona! Muupuwelheke nlhove kiuhimenriakani nno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Manyopani ayo nkayaathama unihiyeni wo waakuviacha, anari oovaka uno atelhiyaka chinene, nkayaattimakacha urwaa uwaalhelhani owiittucha awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vahipinche, Yesu nkaakumaana nkeera “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu.” Nkayamwaatameria, nkayankhoromelha ni ummara mieto chawe, nkayanthimicha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhoove, nrweeke mwaahimerieke ashilhoko aka wiira arwee Ugalilaya, wowo anookona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nttenga wa attu yaalhitelhelha nihiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Manyopani alhe vaari aya mphironi arwaachaka, attu yaalhitelhelha nihiye nkayaarwaa uwani uwahimiacherani opochera ishaani olhupalhe mwaha wonkhaye ukhumelhenlhe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi, opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaakumaanacha vamoka ni ashulhupalhe nkayeewanana, nkayaavaha manyaasikari yaalhitelhelha nihiye alhe nchurukhu mwinchi <verse number="13" style="v"/>yiiraka, “Mwaatti mweereke wiira, owiittucha awe yahowa uhiyu, nkayeeiya iruttu awe hii ninarupilhe ikhove. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ni aholhelhi o utawara eewakaru, hii ninowolhumana ni waahimeria ikekhiaye wiira mwaattiva khanttenke, ni inyu khannopatta milhatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Manyaasikari ayo nkayaawia nchurukhu ulhe, nkayeera thoko chenre aya wo wiittuchihiya. Yoyo mwaha uyo nkawaawanelha mwa Ayahudi mpaka lhelho nna.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakhumelhaka Owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Owiittucha khumi ni mmoka nkayaarwaa umwaakoni Ugalilaya waalhehenre awe Yesu wiira arwaacheke wowo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yamwooneke nkayanthimicha, yaahokhalharu akina yahaarumelhenlhe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu nkachushera vakhiviru waya, nkaahimia wiira, “Kihovahiya ikuru yonkhaye yo wiirimu ni yo velhaponi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nrwaacheke etu, wa attu o makosho onkhaye mwaapangeke ukhalha owiittucha aka, mwaabatiizeke wo nchina ni Athithi, ni no Mwaana, ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, <verse number="20" style="v"/>mwettuchiheke uvara malhehero onkhaye yuvanheakani. Ni mii kinolhokelha vamoka ni inyu mahuku onkhaye, mpaka umalha wo ilhapo.”</para>
</usx>
